Group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An Egyptian militant group that has pledged allegiance to the Islamic State extremist organization claimed responsibility on Sunday for the killing of an American petroleum expert, according to the SITE Intelligence Group. Western officials said that the American, an Apache employee named William Henderson, 58, was killed during a carjacking in the desert in August by fighters from one of Egypt’s most dangerous militant groups, Ansar Beit al-Maqdis, which vowed last month to obey the Islamic State. On Sunday, the group released what it said were photographs of Mr. Henderson’s passport and company identification cards. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egypt: Islamic State Allies Say They Killed an American Worker', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt: Islamic State Allies Say They Killed an American Worker', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ansar Beit al-Maqdis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Henderson, William', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T03:56:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rukmini Callimachi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rukmini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Callimachi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/5298c514-2ea9-577e-9b76-3130110797c4', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5298c514-2ea9-577e-9b76-3130110797c4'}, {'abstract': 'Dwyane Wade scored 27 points for Miami after a seven-game absence, and the Heat withstood a strong performance by Anthony, who returned to the Knicks after missing two games with back spasms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/sports/basketball/carmelo-anthony-scores-31-in-return-but-knicks-drop-fifth-straight.html', 'snippet': 'Dwyane Wade scored 27 points for Miami after a seven-game absence, and the Heat withstood a strong performance by Anthony, who returned to the Knicks after missing two games with back spasms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When asked on Sunday afternoon about Amar’e Stoudemire’s recent assertion that the Knicks were lacking urgency, enthusiasm, focus, intensity, aggressiveness, poise, energy and heart — among other things — Derek Fisher did not quite disagree. He only pointed out that it was perhaps not quite that simple. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 729}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1686, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/01/sports/