d managed to pull seven survivors and one dead crew member out of the water after the 1,753-ton vessel Oryong 501 sank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — Fifty-two crew members remained missing in the western Bering Sea after their South Korean trawler sank in the frigid water on Monday, government and company officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dozens Missing After South Korean Trawler Sinks in Bering Sea', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'South Korea: Dozens Missing After Trawler Sinks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bering Sea', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T14:58:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sang-Hun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c7279ca-2a83-5576-a651-09f50687c16f', 'word_count': 304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c7279ca-2a83-5576-a651-09f50687c16f'}, {'abstract': 'The honors, presented by the Independent Filmmaker Project, kick off the awards season but they aren’t likely to predict who will take home the gold in February.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/why-the-gotham-awards-are-ahem-a-tad-lightweight/', 'snippet': 'The honors, presented by the Independent Filmmaker Project, kick off the awards season but they aren’t likely to predict who will take home the gold in February.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The 24th Gotham Independent Film Awards are tonight! They kick off the Hollywood movie awards season! (Not counting the Governors Awards or the Hollywood Film Awards.) They mark the new Bagger’s first go on the red carpet! (Except for that time in September at the Toronto International Film Festival.) ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1363, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/26/arts/umathurman/umathurman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why the Gotham Awards Are, Ahem, a Tad Lightweight', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gotham Independent Film Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thurman, Uma', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T15:00:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60bd3d39-ba25-5410-8e84-e087b6eb4e23', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60bd3d39-ba25-5410-8e84-e087b6eb4e23'}, {'abstract': 'The house has coiled a serpent around an exotic emerald to create a one-of-a-kind platinum piece with 1,700 diamonds.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/cartier-diamond-cuff/', 'snippet': 'The house has coiled a serpent around an exotic emerald to create a one-of-a-kind platinum piece with 1,700 diamonds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever since Louis Cartier began designing diamond vipers in 1910, the French house has dreamed up a menagerie of lithe creatures, ranging from onyx-studded panthers to gold crocodiles. Now Cartier has coiled a serpent around an exotic gem to create a one-of-a-kind platinum cuff. Handcrafted in the jeweler’s atelier atop its boutique on the Rue de la Paix in Paris, the piece required seven artisans — one wax sculptor to create the shape, two jewelers, three setters (one just for the center stone) and a polisher — and about 2,000 hours of work. The result is a stunning snake, made up of 1,700 diamonds, tightly clutching its coveted prize: a 53.78-carat cabochon-cut rare emerald from Brazil.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '86', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 720}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1707, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/t-magazine/07holiday-qual-cartier/07holiday-qual-cartier-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A One-of-a-Kind Cuff from Cartier', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Thing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diamonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cartier SA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_dat