1bca0c', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4c3f641-5d57-590d-8e61-ef3b1d1bca0c'}, {'abstract': 'Sales were strong for Broadway shows during Thanksgiving week, adding up to $34.1 million for the 36 shows.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/a-happy-holiday-week-for-broadway/', 'snippet': 'Sales were strong for Broadway shows during Thanksgiving week, adding up to $34.1 million for the 36 shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Broadway producers – especially at Disney – had much to be thankful for last week as ticket sales ballooned for many musicals and some plays through the holiday, the highest-grossing and best-attended Thanksgiving week yet for the industry. Broadway shows took in $34.1 million, an increase of $2.6 million over the record-setting Thanksgiving week in 2013, according to box office data released on Monday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/theater/01aladdin/01aladdin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/01/theater/01aladdin/01aladdin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/theater/01aladdin/01aladdin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/theater/01aladdin/01aladdin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1467, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/theater/01aladdin/01aladdin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':