descent to a heroin addict whose home on Staten Island served as a drug-dealing center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an on Sunday article, “Heroin Takes Over a House, and Mom, on New York’s Staten Island,” David Goodman and Michael Wilson described 45-year-old Laurie Sperring’s descent from suburban mother to a heroin addict whose home on Wood Court on Staten Island served as a drug-dealing center. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Heroin Beat: Dispatch from Staten Island', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T22:20:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman and Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2aa29f37-212b-53c7-a765-23eeadce8a5e', 'word_count': 890, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2aa29f37-212b-53c7-a765-23eeadce8a5e'}, {'abstract': 'Like doing our taxes, signing up for Medicare Part D, the insurance program for drug coverage, takes days out of our lives and leaves us sitting in a heap of papers with a splitting headache.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/part-d-for-drug-coverage-and-drudgery/', 'snippet': 'Like doing our taxes, signing up for Medicare Part D, the insurance program for drug coverage, takes days out of our lives and leaves us sitting in a heap of papers with a splitting headache.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Death and taxes have always been twinned in cliché for their unavoidable awfulness. But death only happens to each of us once, not annually. Wouldn’t our annual encounter with the Internal Revenue Service be more aptly paired with the Medicare Part D open enrollment period, a yearly torture between mid-October and early December? Both take days out of our lives and leave us sitting in a heap of papers with a splitting headache and residual worry that we got something wrong and will wind up in jail or the poorhouse. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Part D for Drug Coverage — and Drudgery', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T22:21:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Gross', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gross', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8692df51-5aef-59c0-beaf-83d24e0efc33', 'word_count': 1080, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8692df51-5aef-59c0-beaf-83d24e0efc33'}, {'abstract': 'The violinist Kyung Wha Chung, sidelined by injury for almost a decade, returns to the London concert stage on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/02/arts/music/kyung-wha-chung-makes-comeback-at-southbank-center-london.html', 'snippet': 'The violinist Kyung Wha Chung, sidelined by injury for almost a decade, returns to the London concert stage on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Billed as “The Legend Returns,” with life-size posters on the London Underground, Kyung Wha Chung’s concert at the Southbank Center on Tuesday has been advertised as if it were a movie about a prizefighter’s comeback. “It wasn’t my idea,” she said, agreeing to put the whole thing down to record company hype.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/arts/CHUNG/CHUNG-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Overcoming Injury, a Violinist Returns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Overcoming Injury, a Violinist Returns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chung, Kyung-Wha', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T22:27:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael White', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'White', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/029aee3e-976b-5521-b27c-4a30dcb1d3e2', 'word_count': 1048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/029aee3e-976b-5521-b27c-4a30dcb1d3e2'}, {'abstract': 'The victim of a cycling accident found that his body shielded him from much of the pain.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/i-was-my-own-trauma-unit/', 'snippet': 'The victim of a cycling accident found that his body shielded him from much of the pain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I don’t remember the moments before the accident, but I have a very keen memory of what happened just after.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/science/02BIKE/02BIKE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I Was My Own Trauma Unit', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I Was My Own Trauma Unit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMNESIA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memory', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T22:29:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Kanter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kanter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/639d13bd-23ec-5ca3-9ff6-cdfbc0692020', 'word_count': 1237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/639d13bd-23ec-5ca3-9ff6-cdfbc0692020'}, {'abstract': 'Just in time for the holidays, the woman behind the label has curated a selection of vintage books, records, jewelry and other objects for sale online.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/nili-lotan-holiday-gifts/', 'snippet': 'Just in time for the holidays, the woman behind the label has curated a selection of vintage books, records, jewelry and other objects for sale online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the decade-plus since she established her eponymous fashion label, Nili Lotan has been dressing women in luxury staples, like her signature military jackets and oversized knits, that suggest a laid-back, effortlessly with-it lifestyle. Now, through a special sale beginning today on her web site, Lotan is further fleshing out this picture via a personally curated selection of one-off accouterments including vintage books and records and new and antique jewelry. “I found these pieces to be inspiring and intriguing,” says Lotan of the collection, highlights of which include a book of photographs from Tina Modotti, Bob Dylan’s “Hard Rain” album and a vintage 1940s brown alligator clutch. “This is not only an extension of my brand, but also my own holiday wish list.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/01/t-magazine/01lotan-bobb/01lotan-bobb-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Designer Nili Lotan’s Website, a Trove of Thoughtful Gifts', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lotan, Nili', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-01T22:30:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooke Bobb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooke', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22e0c5b6-dc0c-5fdc-86ea-91ba1fa6381a', 'word_count': 123, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22e0c5b6-dc0c-5fdc-86ea-91ba1fa6381a'}, {'abstract': 'The Belmond Copacabana Palace in Rio de Janeiro is offering a sunrise picnic with sweeping views of the city.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/01/rio-real-early/', 'snippet': 'The Belmond Copacabana Palace in Rio de Janeiro is offering a sunrise picnic with sweeping views of the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Late risers may grumble at the pickup time for Belmond Copacabana Palace’s new sunrise picnic, but the views promise to be worth it.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source'