act': 'The National Basketball Association recently released a collection of holiday-themed sweaters for all 30 teams that defy easy description.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/02/sports/team-holiday-sweaters-are-so-bad-theyre-amazing.html', 'snippet': 'The National Basketball Association recently released a collection of holiday-themed sweaters for all 30 teams that defy easy description.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cole Aldrich is familiar with his teammates’ bold fashion choices: the hats and the scarves, the culottes and the high tops. The Knicks’ locker room is not a place for the meek.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1015, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 1621, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/02/sports/SWEATERS1silo/SWEATERS1silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '