er, Sang Aung Bau Hkum, was feeding his own addiction: heroin, the drug of choice among the men who work the bleak terrain of gouged earthen pits, shared needles and dwindling hope here in the jungles of northern Myanmar.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Searching for Burmese Jade, and Finding Misery ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Searching for Burmese Jade, and Finding Misery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jade', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-02T03:26:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Levin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Levin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfe031a0-9221-55cb-a542-538a3c29249b', 'word_count': 2244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfe031a0-9221-55cb-a542-538a3c29249b'}, {'abstract': 'Turkey is continuing to push the Obama administration to impose a no-fly zone or safe area along the Turkish-Syrian border, administration officials said Monday, but obstacles remain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/02/world/middleeast/no-agreement-reached-on-syrian-no-fly-zone.html', 'snippet': 'Turkey is continuing to push the Obama administration to impose a no-fly zone or safe area along the Turkish-Syrian border, administration officials said Monday, but obstacles remain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Turkey is continuing to push the Obama administration to impose a no-fly zone or safe area along the Turkish-Syrian border, administration officials said Monday, but obstacles remain to the United States’ committing to what would be a significant increase in American military engagement in the area.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Agreement Reached on Syrian No-Fly Zone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Agreement Reached on Syrian No-Fly Zone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'No-Fly Zones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-02T03:28:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18cafbce-d404-510c-b8d3-b88555d845be', 'word_count': 576, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18cafbce-d404-510c-b8d3-b88555d845be'}, {'abstract': 'Manhattan’s famously private park is open, at least virtually, to the public after a visitor took several 360-degree panoramas and posted them on Google Maps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/02/nyregion/peek-in-gramercy-park-key-no-longer-required.html', 'snippet': 'Manhattan’s famously private park is open, at least virtually, to the public after a visitor took s