ight': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/business/international/03life/03life-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/business/international/03life/03life-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/03/business/international/03life/03life-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/business/international/03life/03life-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Insurance Firms Aviva and Friends Life Agree to $8.8 Billion Merger', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Life Insurance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aviva PLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Friends Life Group', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-02T09:38:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ad93a04-6d8c-56eb-8da2-17dee0674a8b', 'word_count': 595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ad93a04-6d8c-56eb-8da2-17dee0674a8b'}, {'abstract': 'Stories about smaller environmental problems can distract us from the slow-motion calamity that will eventually threaten every living being.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/magazine/are-we-missing-the-big-picture-on-climate-change.html', 'snippet': 'Stories about smaller environmental problems can distract us from the slow-motion calamity that will eventually threaten every living being.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The human hands in blue medical gloves spread out the swallow’s wings. The brown feathers jut out like spikes, their tips frizzled and scorched. These wings are no longer graceful fans capable of cupping and pushing off against the air. The left one is worse than the right, and the tail is a pitiful cluster of sticks. This is the wreckage of a bird, the ruin of it. The beauty of a rough-winged swallow is in its flight, the way its darting, swooping path carves arabesques through the skies. Not this bird.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/magazine/07lede1/07mag-07lede.t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 932, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/magazine/07lede1/07mag-07lede.t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 932}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/magazine/07lede1/07mag-07lede.t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/magazine/07lede1/07mag-07lede.t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1319, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}