llions of families navigating the immigration bureaucracy and justice system is the next crisis coming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/03/opinion/on-immigration-a-huge-job-ahead.html', 'snippet': 'Getting the resources required to handle the millions of families navigating the immigration bureaucracy and justice system is the next crisis coming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is an immigration crisis looming, but it’s not at the border. It will be hitting in offices and courtrooms, and be measured in mountains of paper and strained bank accounts, in long lines and delays. It will be caused by the critical shortage of lawyers and other legal assistance for families navigating the immigration bureaucracy and justice system. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Immigration, a Huge Job Ahead', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Immigration, a Huge Job Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T02:41:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb5942fd-bc61-57be-8013-bb4c843129ad', 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb5942fd-bc61-57be-8013-bb4c843129ad'}, {'abstract': 'The drenching rainstorm that settled in California on Tuesday came as the state wheezed its way into the fourth year of the worst drought in centuries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/03/us/in-midst-of-californias-drought-a-rainy-day-is-a-welcome-sight.html', 'snippet': 'The drenching rainstorm that settled in California on Tuesday came as the state wheezed its way into the fourth year of the worst drought in centuries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — This might be the only state in the nation where a rainy day — complete with blinding sheets of water, shoe-sopping flooded intersections and chalk gray skies — puts people in a good mood.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/us/WATER1/WATER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Midst of California’s Drought, a Rainy Day Is a Welcome Sight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Midst of California’s Drought, a Rainy Day Is a Welcome Sight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Landslides and Mudslides', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T02:42:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nagourney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nagourney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57cb05bb-6039-5f86-a3d6-f0d4a5d4adb5', 'word_count': 873, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57cb05bb-6039-5f86-a3d6-f0d4a5d4adb5'}, {'abstract': 'The governor’s veto of a bill that would ban gestation crates probably plays less well in New Jersey than in ... oh, let’s say Iowa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/03/opinion/christies-pig-crate-politics.html', 'snippet': 'The governor’s veto of a bill that would ban gestation crates probably plays less well in New Jersey than in ... oh, let’s say Iowa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I don’t know how Chris Christie plans to become president, but then again no one could have predicted George W. Bush, or for that matter Barack Obama, so we know that stranger things have happened. In any case, I’d love to see the guy’s political prospects fall apart over pork, and not the kind you’re thinking of. Rather, I’m hoping he’ll become a primary example of how reactionary food policy will no longer play.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/bittman-circular/bittman-circular-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/bittman-circular/bittman-circular-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/bittman-circular/bittman-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/bittman-circular/bittman-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/bittman-circular/bittman-circular-thumbLarge-v5.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Christie’s Pig-Crate Politics', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factory Farming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pigs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anim