-grace-huang-cleared-in-daughters-death-are-set-to-leave-qatar.html', 'snippet': 'Officials offered assurances that the couple would be allowed to leave the country after an appellate court exonerated them in the 2013 death of their 8-year-old girl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matthew and Grace Huang, the American couple in Qatar exonerated in the death of their adopted African daughter after a nearly two-year prosecution collapsed on appeal, were preparing to fly home on Wednesday. Qatari and United States officials, including Secretary of State John Kerry, offered assurances that all bureaucratic entanglements that had blocked the couple’s departure for three days had been resolved.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Matthew and Grace Huang, Cleared in Daughter’s Death, Are Set to Leave Qatar ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Qatar: Couple Set to Return to U.S. After Being Exonerated', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qatar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huang, Grace', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huang, Matthew', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T03:39:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77155b5f-78ff-5b56-99a9-7c72b28cb594', 'word_count': 439, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77155b5f-78ff-5b56-99a9-7c72b28cb594'}, {'abstract': 'Coach Rex Ryan said Tuesday that the lack of a passing game in Monday’s loss to Miami was not because of a lack of confidence in quarterback Geno Smith.', 'web_url'