b05', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a27bd85-6fc7-51fe-89df-62e51f737b05'}, {'abstract': 'The Fed official, who successfully pushed in 2012 for more action to reduce unemployment, warns that interest rates must not be raised prematurely.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/04/upshot/q-and-a-with-charles-evans-of-the-fed-low-inflation-is-primary-focus-.html', 'snippet': 'The Fed official, who successfully pushed in 2012 for more action to reduce unemployment, warns that interest rates must not be raised prematurely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charles Evans, president of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, is nervous about inflation. His worry, however, is not the old Fed fear that prices are rising too quickly, but the new Fed fear that prices are not rising fast enough.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 791, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1583, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/04/upshot/04up-fed/04up-fed-thum