s in Phnom Penh', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '36 Hours in Phnom Penh', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lindt, Naomi', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Phnom Penh (Cambodia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T17:58:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Naomi Lindt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Naomi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lindt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bcd217fb-64cd-503b-b145-57371b55223a', 'word_count': 1555, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bcd217fb-64cd-503b-b145-57371b55223a'}, {'abstract': 'Sadhvi Niranjan Jyoti, asked an audience “whether you want a government of those born of Ram, or those born illegitimately.” Ram is a Hindu god.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/04/world/asia/sadhvi-niranjan-jyoti-dismissal-sought-in-india.html', 'snippet': 'Sadhvi Niranjan Jyoti, asked an audience “whether you want a government of those born of Ram, or those born illegitimately.” Ram is a Hindu god.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Opposition lawmakers in India pressed Prime Minister Narendra Modi to dismiss his junior minister for food processing industries Wednesday after she gave a speech interpreted by some as derogatory to non-Hindus.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/world/MODI/MODI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/04/world/MODI/MODI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheig