': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ireland', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T22:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abce8ec4-06da-5c14-8208-7b64f96bcbe8', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abce8ec4-06da-5c14-8208-7b64f96bcbe8'}, {'abstract': 'The restaurant group Happy Cooking Hospitality created the recipes for the non-profit Edible Schoolyard Project’s Toast and Taste benefit this week.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/03/holiday-cocktail-recipes/', 'snippet': 'The restaurant group Happy Cooking Hospitality created the recipes for the non-profit Edible Schoolyard Project’s Toast and Taste benefit this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday night, the New York branch of the Edible Schoolyard Project, the non-profit founded in Berkeley by Alice Waters to promote healthy eating principles among underserved children, hosted a “Toast and Taste” cocktail party at Haven’s Kitchen, the event space, specialty food shop and recreational cooking school in Chelsea. The event brought together chefs from the Happy Cooking Hospitality family of restaurants, including James McDuffee of Joseph Leonard, Michael Toscano of Jeffrey’s Grocery, Perla and Montmartre and Mehdi Brunet-Benkritly of Fedora and Bar Sardine, who prepared small bites to accompany seasonal cocktails by Happy Cooking’s director of bar operations, Brian Bartels. Over two levels at Haven’s Kitchen, guests enjoyed snacks, conversation — and at least a few of Bartels’s cocktails, the recipes for which he shared exclusively with T. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/03/t-magazine/03schoolyard-symonds/03schoolyard-symonds-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Holiday-Ready Cocktail Recipes', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-03T22: