 with classical, contemporary and regional material, from Bach to Gilbert and Sullivan and on to Leonard Cohen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/04/arts/dance/brian-macdonald-canadian-choreographer-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Macdonald, a director and choreographer, worked with classical, contemporary and regional material, from Bach to Gilbert and Sullivan and on to Leonard Cohen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Macdonald, a Montreal-born choreographer and director whose inventive work over more than a half-century helped deepen the footprint of Canadian artists in ballet and musical theater, died on Saturday at his home in Stratford, Ontario. He was 86.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 910, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 910}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1351, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/04/arts/MACDONALD-obit/MACDONALD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75