nabis brand,” Kate Simon’s photos of him portray a man whose life and legacy transcend simple labels.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/04/bob-marley-the-rastaman-vibration-continues/', 'snippet': 'Despite recent efforts to cast Marley as the face of a “global cannabis brand,” Kate Simon’s photos of him portray a man whose life and legacy transcend simple labels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kate Simon first photographed Bob Marley at the July 1975 gig that kicked off his global career, and in the six short years that remained of his life, she photographed him again and again: at home in London or Jamaica, on the road, with heads of state or among the friends who knew him as a neighbor, not a celebrity. She has some thoughts about the man and how the public perceived him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Marley: The Rastaman Vibration Continues', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hashish', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reggae Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manley, Michael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marley, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Genesis (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jamaica (West Indies)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-04T10:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Leland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d7f7779-3a21-5c89-89cb-37fdedcdbc9e', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d7f7779-3a21-5c89-89cb-37fdedcdbc9e'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Huang Jiefu, a surgeon in charge of revamping China’s organ transplant system, gave the firmest deadline to date for ending the widely criticized practice.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/04/china-sets-jan-1-deadline-for-ending-transplants-from-executed-prisoners/', 'snippet': 'Dr. Huang Jiefu, a surgeon in charge of revamping China’s organ transplant system, gave the firmest deadline to date for ending the widely criticized practice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China will stop using organs from executed prisoners in transplants on Jan. 1, the firmest deadline given to date for ending the widely criticized practice, an official said this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/world/05sino-TRANSPLANT/05sino-TRANSPLANT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/05/world/05sino-TRANSPLANT/05sino-TRANSPLANT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/world/05sino-TRANSPLANT/05sino-TRANSPLANT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/world/05sino-TRANSPLANT/05sino-TRANSPLANT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/world/05sino-TRANSPLANT/05sino-TRANSPLANT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'