a55c5', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f6e29f7-229d-58d7-924b-7fe6280a55c5'}, {'abstract': 'The former secretary of state praised plans for a task force to review police tactics after high-profile cases involving unarmed black men killed by white officers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/05/us/politics/hillary-rodham-clinton-backs-us-inquiry-into-police-chokehold-death.html', 'snippet': 'The former secretary of state praised plans for a task force to review police tactics after high-profile cases involving unarmed black men killed by white officers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton said Thursday that she supported President Obama’s decision to form a task force to review police tactics and praised the Justice Department’s decision to investigate the death of an unarmed black man at the hands of a white police officer on Staten Island.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton Backs U.S. Inquiry Into Police Chokehold Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-04T23:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier':