stract': 'In “Delusions of Guinevere,” a former child actress uses social media to get attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/05/movies/delusions-of-guinevere-a-comedy-starring-ariana-bernstein.html', 'snippet': 'In “Delusions of Guinevere,” a former child actress uses social media to get attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twenty years ago, Guinevere James was a child actor in a hit commercial. Nowadays, she’s still acting, but with no visibility whatsoever. While scrambling for work, she stumbles onto a way to get back on the radar, posting videos of herself eating breakfast cereal. (If you don’t think that could be a thing, you don’t know YouTube.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1243, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05DELUSIONS/05DELUSIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 