e/3f645066-8908-53fc-abf2-def4d666446d'}, {'abstract': 'Galvin Harris, distressed at Eric Garner’s death, reflected on an Orwell essay: “They didn’t want to look like fools. People had cellphones. They had to perform.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/05/nyregion/orwell-eric-garner-chokehold-and-the-need-to-look-like-a-sahib.html', 'snippet': 'Galvin Harris, distressed at Eric Garner’s death, reflected on an Orwell essay: “They didn’t want to look like fools. People had cellphones. They had to perform.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'After all, you still have to go to work, so Galvin Harris boarded an A train in Harlem on Thursday afternoon on his way to take care of a house in Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/05/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'sub