ri': 'nyt://article/f262997a-8216-5f26-9e33-b418716bb2ae'}, {'abstract': 'In “The Illusionists” at the Marriott Marquis Theater, seven magicians perform with the accompaniment of a band, laser beams, digital video screens and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/05/theater/the-illusionists-a-high-tech-magic-extravaganza.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Illusionists” at the Marriott Marquis Theater, seven magicians perform with the accompaniment of a band, laser beams, digital video screens and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a trick I’d like to see some world-class magician perform: Make the Marriott Marquis Theater, the monolithic hotel that houses it and the monstrous video screen that now wraps around its facade — turning an ugly building even uglier — disappear. And then keep waving that wand and bring back the five Broadway theaters that were demolished when this Times Square eyesore was built. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/05/arts/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO/05JPILLUSIONISTS3-4_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '