of public-private investments.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/12/05/balfour-beatty-rejects-bid-for-its-investment-arm/', 'snippet': 'The John Laing Infrastructure Fund, a European investor, had offered to pay about $1.6 billion for the company’s portfolio of public-private investments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The British construction and services company Balfour Beatty said on Friday that it had rejected a takeover bid for its investment arm by the John Laing Infrastructure Fund, a European investor in schools, hospitals and transportation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':