snippet': 'The Duveen Brothers gallery at Fifth Avenue and 56th Street was one of the most sumptuous structures ever built in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another pearl in the strand of elegance that once characterized 57th Street was, like Bonwit Teller, a half-block away: the 1913 Duveen Brothers gallery at Fifth Avenue and 56th Street. One of the most sumptuous structures ever built in New York, it was the headquarters of Joseph Duveen, one of the most famous art dealers of the early 20th century.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 574}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 979, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1958, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/07/realestate/07SCAPES1SUB4/07SCAPES1SUB4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image