cers form their own show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/love-and-marriage-to-a-sondheim-score.html', 'snippet': 'Two television producers form their own show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a producer of hard news for television, Barbara Simon was used to covering natural disasters, terrorist attacks and wars. A self-described “news nun,” she said that she had difficulty displaying emotion and that finding relaxation was often challenging. So in the summer of 2011, when she and Margaret Pergler went to a screening of a concert performance of Stephen Sondheim’s and George Furth’s “Company,” no one was more surprised than Ms. Pergler to see her colleague dab her eyes. Ms. Pergler, who had never seen a crack in Ms. Simon’s sober reserve, was touched.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/07VOWS-1/7VOWS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/07VOWS-1/7VOWS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/07VOWS-1/7VOWS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/07VOWS-1/7VOWS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/fashion/weddings/07VOWS-1/7VOWS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand