t the utility of a full-size pickup in a somewhat smaller package.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/automobiles/autoreviews/review-2015-chevrolet-colorado.html', 'snippet': 'With the 2015 Colorado, Chevrolet is betting there are buyers who want the utility of a full-size pickup in a somewhat smaller package.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Automakers routinely try to create new segments, hoping an unusual vehicle will find a fresh set of customers. But with the 2015 Chevrolet Colorado, General Motors is aiming at an old segment that’s been largely abandoned and forgotten: the midsize pickup. And G.M. is betting there are buyers who want the utility of a pickup in a somewhat smaller package than the full-size Chevy Silverado.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO/COLORADO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 221, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO/COLORADO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 221}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO/COLORADO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO/COLORADO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 2010, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO/COLORADO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/07/automobiles/COLORADO