 me once a year on a reporting trip to the developing world. The aim is to generate interest in global poverty issues both with the contest and with the blogging and videos that the winner will contribute to the New York Times website. HBO did a documentary called “Reporter” based on my 2007 win-a-trip journey to Congo; it’s on Amazon and iTunes if you want to see what you’re getting yourself in for.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Win a Trip in 2015', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Contests and Prizes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kristof, Nicholas D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Center for Global Development', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-06T20:33:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4243abac-c4d8-5150-88f5-976dcfe8ad71', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4243abac-c4d8-5150-88f5-976dcfe8ad71'}, {'abstract': 'The Swiss national, Lorenzo Vinciguerra, had been held for more than two years by Abu Sayyaf militants in the southern Philippines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/world/asia/swiss-hostage-escapes-rebels-during-philippine-army-raid-.html', 'snippet': 'The Swiss national, Lorenzo Vinciguerra, had been held for more than two years by Abu Sayyaf militants in the southern Philippines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANILA — As the