://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/us/martin-litton-fighter-for-environment-dies-at-97.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Litton, a former director of the Sierra Club, was unrelenting in his efforts to preserve what was left of the wilderness in the American West, most notably the Grand Canyon and the Colorado River.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martin Litton, an environmentalist, river pilot, writer and unrelenting forward scout in the battle to preserve what was left of the wilderness in the American West, most notably the Grand Canyon and the Colorado River, died on Nov. 30 at his home in Portola Valley, Calif. He was 97.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 921, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 921}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 668, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1335, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/07/us/dog-LITTON-obit/dog-LITTON-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subty