rus, but it has wreaked havoc in the N.H.L. this season. Players from four teams as well as two on-ice officials have been sidelined by the illness, with several cases occurring in the last few days. More players and personnel may contract mumps in the coming days and weeks.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 484, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 484}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 826, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1652, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/sports/MUMPS1/MUMPS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mumps Outbreak Prompts N.H.L. Teams to Take Precautions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mumps Outbreak Prompts N.H.L. Teams to Take Precautions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mumps', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-07T13:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/580377e4-8053-5d7d-96f5-93c7fc15b113', 'word_count': 761, 'uri': 'nyt://article/580377e4-8053-5d7d-96f5-93c7fc15b113'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: As Russian legions poured into the plains of Hungary, the arms were being dismounted and sent to an uneasy Vienna, in 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/1914-big-guns-from-pola-to-defend-austrian-capital/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: As Russian legions poured into the plains of Hungary, the arms were being dismounted and sent to an uneasy Vienna, in 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — As the Russian legions pour into the plains of Hungary, the Viennese are getting uneasy. It was learned from Vienna to-day [Dec. 7] that the big guns defending Pola are being dismounted and sent to Vienna, while the garrison of the town is also being hurried toward the Austrian capital. Food is daily rising in price at Vienna. The cost of chocolate and cocoa has doubled and foodstuffs generally are becoming exhausted. The shop windows are becoming empty and taxicabs have stopped running because the military authorities have confiscated the entire supply of petroleum and have forbidden the refineries to supply the trade. The stocks of dealers will be exhausted soon. Signor Salandra’s speech is still the subject of conversation here. In normal times, no doubt, the cry of “Long Iive an Italian Trieste!” which re-echoed through the Chamber of Deputies after this important pronouncement, would have resulted in a diplomatic protest, but on this occasion the Austro-Hungarian Ambassador has remained silent. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Dec. 8, 1914', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/blogs/08iht-olddec08-1914/08iht-olddec08-1914-jumbo.png', 'height': 454, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/blogs/08iht-olddec08-1914/08iht-olddec08-1914-superJumbo.png', 'height': 454, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/blogs/08iht-olddec08-1914/08iht-olddec08-1914-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/08/blogs/08iht-olddec08-1914/08iht-olddec08-1914-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/08/blogs/08iht-olddec08-1914/08iht-olddec08-1914-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: Big Guns From Pola to Defend Austrian Capital', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 