 {'abstract': 'Onerous and outdated tax-filing requirements make life very difficult for American expatriates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/08/opinion/why-im-giving-up-my-american-citizenship-passport.html', 'snippet': 'Onerous and outdated tax-filing requirements make life very difficult for American expatriates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — THE mayor of London, Boris Johnson, who was born in New York and holds both American and British passports, recently said that he would not pay a tax bill from the United States on capital gains from the sale of his home in the London borough of Islington. Mr. Johnson pointed out that he hasn’t lived in America since he was 5. He’d like to renounce his citizenship, but said the process was “very difficult.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why I’m Giving Up My Passport', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Why I’m Giving Up My Passport', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tepper, Jonathan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Americans Abroad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Passports', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Evasion', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-07T18:50:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_des