y Iranian officials but he was not told what he was being charged with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/08/world/middleeast/jason-rezaian-washington-post-reporter-charged-iran.html', 'snippet': 'After a 10-hour court session, Jason Rezaian, who holds both American and Iranian citizenship, was charged by Iranian officials but he was not told what he was being charged with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEHRAN — A reporter for The Washington Post who has been jailed since July was finally charged by the Iranian authorities in a 10-hour court session on Saturday, his family confirmed on Sunday, but he was not told what he was being charged with.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Washington Post Reporter, Detained in Iran, Is Charged ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Washington Post Reporter, Detained in Iran, Is Charged', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rezaian, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-07T19:15:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Erdbrink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erdbrink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21638b8f-1b72-5e34-a678-71f2012bef1f', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21638b8f-1b72-5e34-a678-71f2012bef1f'}, {'abstract': 'The Orpheus Chamber Orchestra, joined by the violinist Jennifer Koh, presented the New York premiere of Anna Clyne’s “Rest These Hands” at Carnegie Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/08/arts/musi