'uri': 'nyt://article/173361ab-aea0-5d38-9f1b-5baa5fca5f4d'}, {'abstract': 'Despite its rich culture, its memory of war and its present-day prosperity, Dresden is no stranger to right-wingers or hatred of foreigners.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/08/world/in-german-city-rich-with-history-and-tragedy-tide-rises-against-immigration.html', 'snippet': 'Despite its rich culture, its memory of war and its present-day prosperity, Dresden is no stranger to right-wingers or hatred of foreigners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DRESDEN, Germany — As it does every Advent, this history-laden city has erected the gift stalls, the glühwein stands and the Ferris wheel of Germany’s oldest Christmas market, around the Frauenkirche, the 18th-century church that was magnificently rebuilt after the Allies’ catastrophic bombing in 1945. But this year, there is tension behind the seasonal jollity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In German City Rich With History and Tragedy, Tide Rises Against Immigration', 'kicker': 'Dresden Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In German City Rich With History and Tragedy, Tide Rises Against Immigration', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dresden (Germany)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Lutz', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pegida (Germany)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-08T01:38:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Eu