ional and relatively safe bets.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/12/07/after-a-dry-spell-a-boom-in-big-deals/', 'snippet': 'Low interest rates, strong stock prices and healthy capital balances set the scene for a flurry of large acquisitions, most of them traditional and relatively safe bets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A banner year for mergers and acquisitions was spurred by a return to the bargaining table of strategic buyers in a range of different industries. From health care to media, big corporations struck transformative deals, often consolidating industries by buying up competitors. Deals begat deals, and a flurry of reactionary acquisitions followed.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/11/business/dealbook/11STRATEGY1/11-STRATEGY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/11/business/dealbook/11STRATEGY1/11-STRATEGY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/11/business/dealbook/11STRATEGY1/11-STRATEGY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/11/business/dealbook/11STRATEGY1/11-STRATEGY-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/11/business/dealbook/11STRATEGY1/11STRATEGY1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/11/business/de