y collection by Shelly Oria straddles America and Israel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/09/books/new-york-1-tel-aviv-0-stories-by-shelly-oria.html', 'snippet': 'A short-story collection by Shelly Oria straddles America and Israel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite the wide variety of relationships on display in Shelly Oria’s “New York 1, Tel Aviv 0,” this debut collection provides a surprisingly compelling argument for monogamy. Over the course of 18 stories, Ms. Oria — who was born in Los Angeles and grew up in Israel — introduces characters like a woman with a fetish for married men; an ex-wife still struggling to cope with her former husband’s second marriage; and, in the title story, two Israelis and an American navigating the terrain of a well-established ménage à trois. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09book/09book-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 852, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09book/09book-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 852}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09book/09book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 722, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09book/09book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1443, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09book/09book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/09/books/09boo