devotee of the author Ayn Rand, became her lover and business associate, before going on to write a series of books about self-esteem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/09/us/nathaniel-branden-ayn-rands-collaborator-and-paramour-dies-at-84.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Branden, a devotee of the author Ayn Rand, became her lover and business associate, before going on to write a series of books about self-esteem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nathaniel Branden wrote Ayn Rand a fan letter when he was a teenager in Canada in the 1940s. He wanted to tell her how much he admired “The Fountainhead,” her novel about a brilliant architect’s proud resistance to what he perceived as the world’s inclination toward collectivism and mediocrity.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 757, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 757, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/09/us/BRANDEN-obit/BRANDEN-obit-