al': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/0f80196f-2c3f-519e-8d8d-bcb3d80d5edb', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/0f80196f-2c3f-519e-8d8d-bcb3d80d5edb'}, {'abstract': 'The scathing report, which took five years to produce, is a sweeping indictment of the C.I.A. interrogation program carried out in secret prisons after the Sept. 11 attacks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/10/world/senate-intelligence-committee-cia-torture-report.html', 'snippet': 'The scathing report, which took five years to produce, is a sweeping indictment of the C.I.A. interrogation program carried out in secret prisons after the Sept. 11 attacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate Intelligence Committee on Tuesday issued a sweeping indictment of the Central Intelligence Agency’s program to detain and interrogate terrorism suspects in the years after the Sept. 11 attacks, drawing on millions of internal C.I.A. documents to illuminate practices that it said were more brutal — and far less effective — than the agency acknowledged either to Bush administration officials or to the public.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/world/ALTtorture1/ALTtorture1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Panel Faults C.I.A. Over Brutality and Deceit in Terrorism Interrogations', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Senate Panel Faults C.I.A. Over Brutality and Deceit in Terrorism Interrogations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mazzetti, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torture', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interrogations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Intelligence', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feinstein, Dianne', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mohammed, Khalid Shaikh', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zubaydah, Abu', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-09T16:11:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Maz