pening-did-you-notice/', 'snippet': 'Pre-fall, that other really bigger-than-the-catwalk season that is not shown on the catwalk, officially began last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pre-fall, that other really bigger-than-the-catwalk season that is not shown on the catwalk, officially began last week, but most consumers could be forgiven for failing to notice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pre-Fall Is Happening. Did You Notice?', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-12-09T16:57:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77801902-339c-527d-bc3a-ae0a55448f02', 'word_count': 370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77801902-339c-527d-bc3a-ae0a55448f02'}, {'abstract': 'The veteran character actor talks about being typecast after both “Oz” and “Juno.” Will his “Whiplash” teacher be the next role that becomes a “type”?', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/09/j-k-simmons-and-the-joy-of-playing-a-sadistic-teacher/', 'snippet': 'The veteran character actor talks about being typecast after both “Oz” and “Juno.” Will his “Whiplash” teacher be the next role that becomes a “type”?', 'lead_paragraph': 'J.K. Simmons, a character actor with a 40-year career and a hound dog visage, is best known on the big screen for his roles as Juno’s dad and the Daily Bugle editor in the Tobey Maguire-era “Spider-Mans,” along with his television work on various “Law & Order” incarnations and HBO’s “Oz.” For the last seven-and-a-half years he has also voiced the yellow M&M.', 'source': 'The New York Times'