 votes cast at a party congress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Displaying a popularity unmatched by other Western political leaders, Chancellor Angela Merkel of Germany was re-elected on Tuesday as chairwoman of the center-right Christian Democratic Union with a thumping 96.7 percent of the votes cast at a national party congress.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Merkel, Unchallenged, Is Re-elected Leader of Her Party in Germany', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Germany: Merkel Retains Party Post', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Christian Democratic Union (Germany)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-09T19:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Smale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4086456e-30cf-5023-b2c2-2540f61673f6', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4086456e-30cf-5023-b2c2-2540f61673f6'}, {'abstract': 'Just hours after announcing its $8.4 billion acquisition of Cubist Pharmaceuticals, a Delaware judge invalidated patents owned by the antibiotics maker. Merck appears to have been caught up in the M.&.A. exuberance, says Robert Cyran of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/12/09/mercks-rose-colored-deal-making/', 'snippet': 'Just hours after announcing its $8.4 billion acquisition of Cubist Pharmaceuticals, a Delaware judge invalidated patents owned by the antibiotics maker. Merck appears to have been caught up in the M.&.A. exuberance, says Robert Cyran of Reuters Br...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The M.&A. frenzy appears to have influenced Merck’s risk assessment. Just hours after announcing its $8.4 billion acquisition of Cubist Pharmaceuticals on Monday, a judge invalidated patents owned by the antibiotics maker. Potential lost sales are reflected in the billions erased from Merck’s market value.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-merck2/dbpix-merck2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legac