ing year — the term is pronounced BEE-hag, and it stands for “big, hairy, audacious goals.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big, Hairy Audacious Goals? Give Me Audacious Problem-Solving', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teeth and Dentistry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Carey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Big Ass Fans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-09T20:42:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cliff Oxford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cliff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Oxford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6fc1512-d9c0-5e0b-97af-0072ff8de292', 'word_count': 823, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6fc1512-d9c0-5e0b-97af-0072ff8de292'}, {'abstract': 'We asked you which film you would name best picture, and so many movies got at least one nod.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/09/the-readers-have-spoken/', 'snippet': 'We asked you which film you would name best picture, and so many movies got at least one nod.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the Carpetbagger and expert prognosticators have noted this season, the race for best picture seems to be wide open. Last week we asked you which film you would crown best picture, and taken as a whole, your choices reflected the lack of general consensus.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Readers Have Spoken', 'kicker': 'Ca