album, “Monuments to an Elegy,” and also reveled in their old muscle and majesty at Webster Hall on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One chorus always gets the Smashing Pumpkins’ fans shouting along, as it did when the band played a sold-out Webster Hall on Monday night. It’s an old one, from the 1995 song “Bullet With Butterfly Wings”: “Despite all my rage, I am still just a rat in a cage.” In the band’s 1990s heyday, that fury was one polarity of songs with magnificent mood swings: from rage to all-encompassing love, from bulldozing guitar riffs to lofty melodies. But the latest incarnation of the band — led by its songwriter, singer and guitarist Billy Corgan — is devoted to something else, something lesser: a dogged perseverance, maintaining the band’s presence with a cooler head. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/arts/PUMPKINS/PUMPKINS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Years of Rage and Fury, a Cooler-Headed Sound', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Years of Rage and Fury, a Cooler-Headed Sound', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smashing Pumpkins (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corgan, Billy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-09T22:19:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/18dedbb7-23b6-573d-b9e3-f23204a10044', 'word_count': 449, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18dedbb7-23b6-573d-b9e3-f23204a10044'}, {'abstract': 'Adam E. Livix was charged with weapons possession, and Israeli officials said he had considered attacking Islamic holy sites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/10/world/middleeast/texas-man-charged-in-israel-may-have-sought-to-attack-holy-sites.html', 'snippet': 'Adam E. Livix was charged with weapons possession, and Israeli officials said he had considered attacking Islamic holy sites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — An American man has been charged in an Israeli court with illegal possession of weapons after he admitted under questioning that he had considered carrying out terrorist attacks, includ