d questions about what they perceived Jackson meant when he said the team was developing a loser’s mentality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/10/sports/basketball/losers-mentality-knicks-puzzle-out-phil-jacksons-remark.html', 'snippet': 'Before their loss Tuesday — their ninth straight — the Knicks faced questions about what they perceived Jackson meant when he said the team was developing a loser’s mentality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — Knicks players insisted\xa0Tuesday\xa0that they were not content with losing games. In fact, they said, trying to avoid losing them has become their main obsession. And what is more, that intense desire not to lose games has become so consuming that they have begun neglecting to try to win them.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/10/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1470, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/