asp/', 'snippet': 'The return of Joe DiPietro.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THURSDAY PUZZLE — I don’t believe that I am alone in not liking a lot of cross-referenced clues in my crossword puzzles, but when the cross-referencing is used to good effect, like in today’s puzzle by Joe DiPietro, I am willing to give it a pass. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Elude a Person’s Grasp', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T03:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/961979d7-35c6-5d2a-a6c3-783d949489c3', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/961979d7-35c6-5d2a-a6c3-783d949489c3'}, {'abstract': 'The firm has acquired a roughly 6 percent stake in Staples, a person briefed on the matter said on Wednesday. The hedge fund also bolstered its holdings in Office Depot — where it previously sat on the board — to 10 percent, from 8.6 percent.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/12/10/starboard-said-to-amass-a-big-stake-in-staples/', 'snippet': 'The firm has acquired a roughly 6 percent stake in Staples, a person briefed on the matter said on Wednesday. The hedge fund also bolstered its holdings in Office Depot — where it previously sat on the board — to 10 percent, from 8.6 percent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Starboard Value, the activist hedge fund that ousted the entire board at Darden Restaurants earlier this year, appears to have its sights set on a different sector: office supply retailers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', '