e and told victims not to report their cases to the police.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/us/bob-jones-university-sex-assault-victim-study.html', 'snippet': 'An independent investigation found officials at Bob Jones University, blamed sexual-assault victims for their abuse and told victims not to report their cases to the police.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For decades, officials at Bob Jones University told sexual assault victims that they were to blame for their abuse, and to not report it to the police because doing so would damage their families, churches and the university, according to a long-awaited independent report released Thursday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Jones University Blamed Victims of Sexual Assaults, Not Abusers, Report Says ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bob Jones University Blamed Victims of Sexual Assaults, Not Abusers, Report Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bob Jones University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T16:31:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f776b7c-2eea-53dc-8283-ffc2d434a5d6', 'word_count': 978, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f776b7c-2eea-53dc-8283-ffc2d434a5d6'}, {'abstract': 'The best vocal performances of 2014 may have belonged to Mark Padmore, Javier Camarena, Anna Netrebko and Ted Hearne.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/14/arts/music/the-best-vocal-performances-of-2014.html', 'snippet': 'The best vocal performances of 2014 may have belonged to Mark Padmore, Javier Camarena, Anna Netrebko and Ted Hearne.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two guys, a girl and some WikiLeaks: That sums up the highlights of my year listening to vocal music.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14WOOLFE1/14WOOLFE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Best Classical Vocal Performances of 2014', 'kicker': 'The Year in Culture', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Breakthroughs and High Notes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woolfe, Zachary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Padmore, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T16:31:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Woolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/917f34d4-c4ec-5309-9d8e-d8f02f116c52', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/917f34d4-c4ec-5309-9d8e-d8f02f116c52'}, {'abstract': 'George R. Goldner will become a private art adviser after 21 years heading the department. Nadine M. Orensteinhas been named to succeed him.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/11/chairman-of-met-museums-drawings-and-print-department-to-step-down/', 'snippet': 'George R. Goldner will become a private art adviser after 21 years heading the department. Nadine M. Orensteinhas been named to succeed him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'George R. Goldner, who has been chairman of the Metropolitan Museum of Art’s drawings and prints department for 21 years and strengthened the collection with major works by Leonardo, Pontormo and Albrecht Altdorfer, will step down next month to become a private art adviser, museum officials said. Nadine M. Orenstein, a curator in the department, has been chosen as Mr. Goldner’s successor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin