etti, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brennan, John O', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torture', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interrogations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T17:06:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Mazzetti and Matt Apuzzo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzetti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Apuzzo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be297f6f-9049-5cad-ad76-d8b88a446a54', 'word_count': 1186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be297f6f-9049-5cad-ad76-d8b88a446a54'}, {'abstract': 'As GamerGate shows, the video game industry is fast maturing, but the culture isn’t.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/14/arts/video-games/why-2014-was-a-troubling-year-for-video-games.html', 'snippet': 'As GamerGate shows, the video game industry is fast maturing, but the culture isn’t.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The British novelist and journalist John Lanchester wrote this about video games for The London Review of Books in January 2009: “The next decade or so is going to see the world of video games convulsed by battles between the money men and the artists; if the good guys win, or win enough of the time, we’re going to have a whole new art form.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20