t://article/696e2670-0f8f-5142-bf7a-04d002dd790a'}, {'abstract': 'Young Thug & Bloody Jay and Beyoncé are among those who released exceptional albums in 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/14/arts/music/jon-caramanica-looks-at-the-albums-of-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Young Thug & Bloody Jay and Beyoncé are among those who released exceptional albums in 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '1. Young Thug & Bloody Jay “Black Portland” It was Young Thug’s year, which meant it was a year in which the hip-hop mainstream succumbed to his unlikely charms. Being all over radio was an achievement, but this self-released mixtape was an unrestrained triumph. It’s full of Young Thug hallmarks: asides, growls, chirps, yodels, barks, curlicues. And also songs: sturdy, intoxicating, harrowing, gut-punch songs.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14CARAMANICA1/14CARAMANICA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14CARAMANICA1/14CARAMANICA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14CARAMANICA1/14CARAMANICA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14CARAMANICA1/14CARAMANICA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14CARAMANICA1/14CARAMANICA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_n