 the survival of the poor, the human life cycle, private uncertainties, public responsibilities and the charms of idiocy. Forget the language barrier: The words have an equal partner in Visitante’s music, which encompasses pan-American folk roots, hard rock, symphonic pop and brittle electronics, a world of ideas that can matter.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 668}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 921, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1999, 'width': 1796, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/arts/14PARELES1/14PARELES1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Pareles’s Favorite Albums and Songs of 2014', 'kicker': 'The Year i