bstract': 'Solo’s status for the Women’s World Cup has been in doubt because of a domestic abuse case.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/sports/soccer/hope-solo-asks-for-dismissal-of-domestic-assault-charges.html', 'snippet': 'Solo’s status for the Women’s World Cup has been in doubt because of a domestic abuse case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lawyer for Hope Solo, the United States national team goalkeeper, filed a motion on Thursday seeking to dismiss misdemeanor domestic abuse assault charges that have created uncertainty about Solo’s availability to play in the Women’s World Cup next summer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/12soccer/12soccer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'