k Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Clock’s Ticking on Freedom of Information Reform', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Information Act', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T19:11:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dorothy J. Samuels', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dorothy', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Samuels', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8febed77-6280-5a6c-b0c6-3c9212b8eb68', 'word_count': 306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8febed77-6280-5a6c-b0c6-3c9212b8eb68'}, {'abstract': 'After striking out with Jon Lester, who chose the Cubs, Boston will acquire Wade Miley and Rick Porcello. The Red Sox also reached an agreement with Justin Masterson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/sports/baseball/mlb-winter-meetings-rick-porcello-boston-rex-sox.html', 'snippet': 'After striking out with Jon Lester, who chose the Cubs, Boston will acquire Wade Miley and Rick Porcello. The Red Sox also reached an agreement with Justin Masterson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO — The Boston Red Sox came to the winter meetings hoping that their former ace Jon Lester would rejoin them as a free agent. When Lester instead chose the Chicago Cubs, the Red Sox quickly filled their rotation as the meetings came to a close.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/sports/Y-BASE/Y-BASE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'x