ch-needed clarity on what’s forbidden, and it may curb government excesses, Reynolds Holding of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/12/11/clearer-limits-for-insider-trading-prosecutions/', 'snippet': 'A federal court ruling gives Wall Street some much-needed clarity on what’s forbidden, and it may curb government excesses, Reynolds Holding of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Enforcers have revealed an insider trading line by stepping over it. A federal court on Wednesday threw out the convictions of two hedge fund managers, sharply narrowing the law on improper dealings. Prosecutors should expect more embarrassing reversals.The silver lining is that the ruling gives Wall Street some much-needed clarity on what’s forbidden, and it may curb government excesses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-insider1/dbpix-insider1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-insider1/dbpix-insider1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-insider1/dbpix-insider1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-insider1/dbpix-insider1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/10/business/dbpix-insider1/dbpix-insider1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c