': 'An exhibition of photographs by Yasumasa Morimura mimics a Baroque meme, and hip-hop takes a ballet to a new realm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/nyregion/-postmodern-velzquez-and-a-hip-hop-nutcracker.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition of photographs by Yasumasa Morimura mimics a Baroque meme, and hip-hop takes a ballet to a new realm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Michel Foucault’s \xa0essay on Velázquez’s \xa0baroque masterpiece “Las Meninas,” \xa0he comments on Velázquez’s decision to insert his self-portrait into the painting’s narrative, planting a seed that would bloom into postmodernism.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': ' Postmodern Velázquez and a ‘Hip-Hop Nutcracker’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Postmodern Velázquez and a ‘Hip-Hop Nutcracker’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Luhring Augustine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morimura, Yasumasa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Hip Hop Nutcracker (Ballet)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T20:18:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By A. C. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1fa6815-194d-5348-9b0b-1173a270ca90', 'word_count': 421, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1fa6815-194d-5348-9b0b-1173a270ca90'}, {'abstract': '“Free the Nipple,” directed by Lina Esco, presents itself as part of a broader movement that advocates for a woman’s right to go topless in public.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/movies/free-the-nipple-a-call-to-action.html', 'snippet': '“Free the Nipple,” directed by Lina Esco, presents itself as part of a broader movement that advocates for a woman’s right to go topless in public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The scripted drama “Free the Nipple” presents itself as part of a broader movement that advocates a woman’s right to go topless in public. This form of nudity, provided it’s nonlewd and noncommercial, has been ruled legal by New York State’s highest court, although it has caused confusion among the police. The film suggests that the right to exposed nipples is a matter of free speech and equal protection and that breasts should not be demonized when violent images saturate the media.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FREETHE/FREETHE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FREETHE/FREETHE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FREETHE/FREETHE-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FREETHE/FREETHE-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1150, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FREETHE/FREETHE-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/FR