s before a funding deal deadline that, if missed, could mean a government shutdown, the Office of Management and Budget is preparing for the worst.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hours before a funding deal deadline for averting a government shutdown, the Office of Management and Budget is preparing for the worst.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Talks Drag On, Budget Office Prepares for Shutdown', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T21:19:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf6d5220-6f4e-5e43-bd2c-e9d6cbe1a062', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf6d5220-6f4e-5e43-bd2c-e9d6cbe1a062'}, {'abstract': '“We Are the Giant,” an Arab Spring documentary by Greg Barker, profiles seven charismatic activists agitating for change in Libya, Syria and Bahrain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/movies/we-are-the-giant-a-look-at-the-arab-spring-movement.html', 'snippet': '“We Are the Giant,” an Arab Spring documentary by Greg Barker, profiles seven charismatic activists agitating for change in Libya, Syria and Bahrain.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The revolution is not an apple that falls when it is ripe. You have to make it fall.” That Che Guevara quotation leads off “We Are the Giant,” Greg Barker’s sketchy but spirited documentary polemic about the Arab Spring movement that tries to shake the tree. Che’s words define the attitude of this exhortatory film, which encourages viewers to stand up against tyranny using the nonviolent tactics of Gandhi, Nelson Mandela and the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. It suggests that in the case of the Arab Spring movement, especially in Syria, peaceful protest is not necessarily a good idea. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1802, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12WEARETHEGIANT/WEARETHEGIANT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Agitating for C