pproves-fine-for-group-against-carriage-horses.html', 'snippet': 'The Campaign Finance Board set the penalty at just over $26,000 for making illegal contributions to two City Council candidates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group lobbying to eliminate carriage horses in New York City will pay a $26,054 fine for making illegal campaign contributions to two City Council candidates last year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Panel Approves Fine for Group Against Carriage Horses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Panel Authorizes Fine for Group Against Carriage Horses', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Campaign Finance Board (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NYClass', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carriages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADVANCE GROUP', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, City Councils', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-11T21:31:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nikita Stewart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nikita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stewart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43275996-d26e-5121-b186-b838602bc40a', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43275996-d26e-5121-b186-b838602bc40a'}, {'abstract': 'Ernest Bloch’s unfamiliar and only opera, “Macbeth,” is being performed in a traditional staging by the Manhattan School of Music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/arts/music/macbeth-blochs-only-opera-at-manhattan-school-of-music.html', 'snippet': 'Ernest Bloch’s unfamiliar and only opera, “Macbeth,” is being performed in a traditional staging by the Manhattan School of Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Manhattan School of Music Opera Theater opened a production of “Macbeth” on Wednesday night, but not the one by Verdi that all opera lovers know. This was a rare performance of Ernest Bloch’s “Macbeth,” first performed in Paris in 1910. I was surely not the only person in the audience who had never heard a note of this intriguing opera, a compelling work that brings out the supernatural eeriness and ruthless violence of Shakespeare’s play through music of subdued intensity. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12MACBETH/MACBETH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12MACBETH/MACBETH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12MACBETH/MACBETH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12MACBETH/MACBETH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/12MACBETH/MACBETH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_