ustic pâté that is traditionally made by cooking pork belly or shoulder slowly in abundant fat, allowing it to cool in the fat, then raking the mixture into a spreadable paste. I myself was a vegetarian, or near-vegetarian at the time, so my pleasure was vicarious. I have never been much of a fan of fatty meat dishes, even now, when I eat more meat than I did then (which is still not much), but that is a question of personal taste. I really got what they loved about the rillettes – the flavor and texture are luxurious. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 488, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 488}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1666, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/06/science/13recipehealthalt/13recipehealthalt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima