icle/1d88c784-49e8-502d-aa2d-d364adced0b7', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d88c784-49e8-502d-aa2d-d364adced0b7'}, {'abstract': 'One of the most prolific cheerleaders for the Islamic State, @shamiwitness, is a marketing executive in Bangalore, India, Britain’s Channel 4 News said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/13/world/middleeast/twitter-backer-of-isis-is-identified-as-clean-cut-indian-executive.html', 'snippet': 'One of the most prolific cheerleaders for the Islamic State, @shamiwitness, is a marketing executive in Bangalore, India, Britain’s Channel 4 News said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — As the extremists of the Islamic State rampaged across Syria and Iraq, the Twitter user @ShamiWitness was among their most prolific and widely followed English-language supporters. In a near-constant barrage of posts, he cheered the group’s advances, disparaged its enemies and called on Muslims from around the world to heed the call of jihad.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Twitter Backer of ISIS Is a Clean-Cut Executive in India, British Channel Says ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Twitter Backer of ISIS Is a Clean-Cut Executive in India, British Channel Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangalore (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-12T16:12:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 's