}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd8d9919-5492-50df-95e1-2096215cda10', 'word_count': 1038, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd8d9919-5492-50df-95e1-2096215cda10'}, {'abstract': 'The “Wild” actress says she wasn’t sure she could pull off a role in a film that featured graphic sex and heroin use.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/12/reese-witherspoon-on-self-doubt-and-strong-women/', 'snippet': 'The “Wild” actress says she wasn’t sure she could pull off a role in a film that featured graphic sex and heroin use.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thursday morning was big for Pacific Standard, the production company Reese Witherspoon founded with Bruna Papandrea. The announcement then of the Golden Globe nominations included four for the company’s debut film, “Gone Girl,” and a nod for the actress herself for her performance as a hiker on a journey of self-discovery in “Wild,” which she also produced.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/reeseglobes/reeseglobes-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/reeseglobes/reeseglobes-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/reeseglobes/reeseglobes-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/reeseglobes/reeseglobes-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/12/arts/reeseglobes/reeseglobes-thumbStandard.jp