The authorities said they believed that arsonists, possibly with a far-right motive, were behind the fires that destroyed three buildings near Nuremberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — The German police suspect that arsonists, possibly with a far-right motive, were behind a series of fires that destroyed three buildings in a village near Nuremberg that had been slated to open their doors to several dozen refugees in the coming weeks, officials said Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'German Police Suspect Arson in Destruction of Refugee Shelters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Germany: Refugee Shelters Destroyed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-12T16:54:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f6f5846-375a-532d-bd55-3aa08001d382', 'word_count': 184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f6f5846-375a-532d-bd55-3aa08001d382'}, {'abstract': 'A full-floor apartment at One57, with 6,240 square feet of space that includes four bedrooms and a 75-foot-long entrance gallery, was the sale of the week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.