organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc39e790-a7bd-56ac-99fe-5dfdcdb858d3', 'word_count': 348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc39e790-a7bd-56ac-99fe-5dfdcdb858d3'}, {'abstract': 'In “Picasso at the Lapin Agile,” his play now at the Long Wharf Theater in New Haven, Steve Martin finds a balance of silliness and seriousness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/14/nyregion/a-review-of-picasso-at-the-lapin-agile-by-steve-martin-in-new-haven.html', 'snippet': 'In “Picasso at the Lapin Agile,” his play now at the Long Wharf Theater in New Haven, Steve Martin finds a balance of silliness and seriousness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one seems impressed by the guy with messy hair, sitting alone at a bar in Montmartre on this night in 1904. After all, as we learn early on in “Picasso at the Lapin Agile,” now at the Long Wharf Theater in New Haven, he may claim to be a scientist, but none of his work has ever been published, and he actually spends his days in a menial job at the patent office. It’s like a waiter calling himself an actor although he has never been cast in anything.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/nyregion/14ARTSCT2/14ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/14/nyregion/14ARTSCT2/14ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/nyregion/14ARTSCT2/14ARTSCT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/14/nyregion/14ARTSCT2/14ARTSCT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1434, '