, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d50bb23-b5aa-5ef9-affe-076960f6f3e8', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d50bb23-b5aa-5ef9-affe-076960f6f3e8'}, {'abstract': 'Wearing T-shirts that read “Black Lives Matter” and chanting “I can’t breathe,” demonstrators evoked memories of civil rights marches of the past.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/14/us/thousands-march-in-washington-to-protest-deaths-by-police.html', 'snippet': 'Wearing T-shirts that read “Black Lives Matter” and chanting “I can’t breathe,” demonstrators evoked memories of civil rights marches of the past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — They came to the nation’s capital on buses and planes and minivans and trains, from Florida, Detroit and Staten Island, led as much by the families, friends and supporters of African-American men and boys killed at the hands of the police as by civil rights leaders. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thousands March in Washington to Protest Police Violence', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Thousands March During a Day of Protest Over Police Conduct', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gurley, Akai', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Tamir E (2002-14)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharpton, Al', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject'