 Griffin III’s dive for an apparent score was eventually ruled a fumble out the side of the end zone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/15/sports/football/odell-beckham-jr-and-giants-top-redskins-as-robert-griffin-iii-has-a-touchdown-nullified.html', 'snippet': 'Bekham scored three touchdowns, and the Giants avoided falling too far behind as Robert Griffin III’s dive for an apparent score was eventually ruled a fumble out the side of the end zone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — The glow emanating from the blossoming career of Odell Beckham Jr. has come to this: Many fans in the stands at MetLife Stadium focus their attention on him, and only him, when the Giants’ offense is on the field. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/15/sports/GIANTS1/GIANTS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 