ini-series-on-syfy.html', 'snippet': 'In “Ascension,” it’s 2014 on Earth, but aboard a spacecraft, it’s as if “Mad Men” had been sealed in a giant tin can and shot aloft.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Syfy channel has given us some of 2014’s silliest programming (that “Sharknado” sequel comes to mind), but it has saved one of its slickest offerings for late in the year. “Ascension,” a mini-series running Monday through Wednesday, has an intriguing premise, lots of plot twists and high production values. If you’re sick of sitcoms’ holiday episodes, this alternative is worth a look.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 784}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 784, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1567, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/15/arts/SUB-ASCENSION/SUB-ASCENSION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'