ajor League Baseball.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/15/sports/curacao-becomes-unlikely-supplier-of-major-league-players.html', 'snippet': 'The small country of Curaçao, part of the Kingdom of the Netherlands, has been the source of a surge of talent to Major League Baseball.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TERA KORA, Curaçao — Much of the ground in Curaçao is hard and sandy, full of pebbles and small rocks that are strewn everywhere, including the coarse-dirt infields of this small island nation’s many baseball fields.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Speck on the Map Gushes Talent', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Speck on Map Gushes Talent', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Curacao', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gregorius, Didi (1990- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Balentien, Wladimir', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Profar, Jurickson', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-15T02:17:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cad45d67-d9f5-5954-9ea5-a7f74155aeb8', 'word_count': 1838, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cad45d67-d9f5-5954-9ea5-a7f74155aeb8'}, {'abstract': 'David Denby, a film critic for The New Yorker since 1998, will write “longer critic-at-large pieces” on films, books and other topics, according to the magazine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/15/business/david-denby-to-step-down-as-new-yorker-film-critic.html', 'snippet': 'David Denby, a film critic for The New Yorker since 1998, will write “longer critic-at-large pieces” on films, books and other topics, according to the magazine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Denby, a film critic for The New Yorker since 1998, will step down from that role in early 2015, though he will remain a staff writer, the magazine said over the weekend. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Yorker Film Critic Shifts to Staff Writer ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Yorker Film Critic Shifts to Staff Writer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Denby, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Yorker', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lahr, John', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lane, Anthony', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wolcott, James', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-15T02:19:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_