American diplomat, was turned away at the Cairo airport in a move that had been seen as possible evidence of the military’s crackdown on dissent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/16/world/middleeast/american-scholar-egypt-michele-dunne-visa.html', 'snippet': 'Michele Dunne, a former American diplomat, was turned away at the Cairo airport in a move that had been seen as possible evidence of the military’s crackdown on dissent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — The Egyptian Foreign Ministry said in a statement on Sunday night that the American scholar Michele Dunne had been turned away at Cairo’s airport for trying to enter Egypt without a proper visa, contradicting her account of her expulsion and the reports of several Egyptian news outlets.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': ' Egypt Says It Rejected American Over Visa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt Says It Rejected American Over Visa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkpatrick, David D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dunne, Michele', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Visas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Endowment for International Peace', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-15T13:29:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa43d230-6d28-5c14-bb92-b3fd004c408f', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa43d230-6d28-5c14-bb92-b3fd004c408f'}, {'abstract': 'The Smithsonian’s Freer and Sackler Galleries will put their entire collection — more than 44,000 Asian artworks — online starting Jan. 1.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/15/asian-art-treasures-for-one-and-all/', 'snippet': 'The Smithsonian’s Freer and Sackler Galleries will put their entire collection — more than 44,000 Asian artworks — online starting Jan. 1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following several years of photographing, documenting and digitizing, the Smithsonian’s Freer and Sackler Galleries in Washington will put their entire collections — more than 44,000 Asian artworks, many of which have never been publicly displayed — will be available online starting in the new year. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Asian Art Treasures for One and All', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Asian Art Treasures for One and All', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Institution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-15T13:45:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lori Holcomb-Holland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holcomb-Holland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee9dc4d1-5305-5c47-a82c-8e0d1532c876', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee9dc4d1-5305-5c47-a82c-8e0d1532c876'}, {'abstract': 'BGC Partners said it also expec