s producer, would roughly double Repsol’s oil production.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Talisman Energy, a Canadian oil and gas producer which has been hit by sinking share prices, said on Monday that it was in talks with Repsol of Spain “regarding a potential corporate transaction.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Talisman Energy Confirms Deal Talks With Repsol of Spain', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talisman Energy in Talks Over Sale to Repsol of Spain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Repsol SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Talisman Energy Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T03:05:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6574e15e-8a94-5245-893c-e120256b58bf', 'word_count': 294, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6574e15e-8a94-5245-893c-e120256b58bf'}, {'abstract': 'A divorce left Michael Stratton owing thousands of dollars in back child support payments. He is now working toward a job in information technology.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/16/nyregion/after-working-in-film-a-queens-man-hopes-for-a-life-in-technology.html', 'snippet': 'A divorce left Michael Stratton owing thousands of dollars in back child support payments. He is now working toward a job in information technology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ten years ago, Michael Stratton could be found,