g to offset weakness in France and Germany.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/business/international/auto-sales-inch-higher-in-europe.html', 'snippet': 'Registrations of new passengers cars, a proxy for sales, rose 1.4 percent from November 2013, with manufacturers’ incentives helping to offset weakness in France and Germany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — European car sales rose modestly in November, industry data showed on Tuesday, with manufacturers’ incentives helping to maintain a rising trend despite weakness in France and Germany.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Auto Sales Inch Higher in Europe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Auto Sales Rise for 15th Consecutive Month', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fourquet, Laure', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolly, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "European Automobile Manufacturers' Assn", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Renault SA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Peugeot SA', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T09:52:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laure Fourquet and David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laure', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fourquet', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'm