urnalism, we still sometimes neglect one of its most basic tools: the link.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For all our progress in digital journalism, we sometimes still neglect one of its most basic tools: the link.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beware the Missing Link', 'kicker': 'After Deadline', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T13:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Times Topics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Philip B. Corbett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa28006d-e1e2-561b-a9da-2b2c7704d3b6', 'word_count': 2076, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa28006d-e1e2-561b-a9da-2b2c7704d3b6'}, {'abstract': 'The actress Rachel Tucker sings the number “August Winds” from the Broadway musical “The Last Ship” accompanied by the show’s composer, Sting, on guitar.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/16/in-performance-sting-and-rachel-tucker-of-the-last-ship/', 'snippet': 'The actress Rachel Tucker sings the number “August Winds” from the Broadway musical “The Last Ship” accompanied by the show’s composer, Sting, on guitar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s video features the actress Rachel Tucker singing the number “August Winds” from the Broadway musical “The Last Ship,” accompanied by the show’s composer, Sting, on guitar. Last week Sting joined the cast of the show, a musical drama about British shipbuilders in his hometown, for a four-week run at the Neil Simon Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Sting and Rachel Tucker of ‘The Last Ship’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':