ctors promote the benefits of circumcision in newborns, teenagers and adults, but parents will still make their own decisions—sometimes for unexpected reasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention just released the first proposed federal guidelines on circumcision. Highlighting research suggesting that circumcision helps protect heterosexual men from urinary tract infections, penile cancer, H.I.V. and other sexually transmitted diseases, the C.D.C.plans to recommend that health care providers offer all uncircumcised men and the parents of newborn or uncircumcised boys “comprehensive counseling on the risks and benefits of circumcision.” Having your son circumcised is not just a cultural or religious choice anymore — it’s a public health issue. (Care to comment on that proposal? Click here.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 317, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 317}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 790, 'width': 1497, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION/Motherlode-CIRCUMSION-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Foreskin in the Right Place at the Right Time', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Circumcision', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Penis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T20:29:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica Youngren', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Youngren', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fadf5fd-312d-58e4-b098-0372134fff00', 'word_count': 921, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fadf5fd-312d-58e4-b098-0372134fff00'}, {'abstract': 'Secretary of State John Kerry said the United States had made “no determinations” about efforts toward Security Council resolutions on the Middle East.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/world/middleeast/kerry-says-status-quo-between-israelis-and-palestinians-is-unsustainable.html', 'snippet': 'Secretary of State John Kerry said the United States had made “no determinations” about efforts toward Security Council resolutions on the Middle East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Calling the status quo “unsustainable for both parties and for the region,” Secretary of State John Kerry said here on Tuesday that the United States was working “to lower the temperature” between Israelis and Palestinians, amid Palestinian and European efforts for United Nations Security Council resolutions that would pressure Israel on the timing and shape of peace talks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/world/17kerry/17kerry-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Tries to Calm Latest Israeli and Palestinian Strife', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Tries to Calm Latest Israeli and Palestinian Strife', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T20:29:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73a9ddd4-97af-5ef5-9e08-be02094ff985', 'word_count': 612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73a9ddd4-97af-5ef5-9e08-be02094ff985'}, {'abstract': 'Skinfix’s hand-repair cream, based on a formula from 1850, is an affordable indulgence to combat winter dehydration.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/16/skinfix-dry-skin-miracle-balm/', 'snippet': 'Skinfix’s hand-repair cream, based on a formula from 1850, is an affordable indulgence to combat winter dehydration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1850, a compound chemist in Yorkshire, England named Thomas Dixon created a “miracle balm” that 162 years later landed in the hands of the beauty-industry veteran Amy Regan. She acquired the formula in 2012 when she bought the brand Skinfix from Dixon’s great-great-great-granddaughter. Since then, Regan, who has had stints at L’Oréal, Coty and Estée Lauder, has used the rich and reparative recipe, which is anhydrous (containing no water, unlike most moisturizers on the market, which have a high percentage), to create products like this new hand-repair cream. It’s already garnering a cult following — and its price tag (just $20!) doesn’t hurt.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/16/t-magazine/16skinfix-bobb/16skinfix-bobb-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unassuming Miracle Worker for Dry Skin', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'orga