spaper and its primary union said 21 union-represented employees would be let go by the end of the week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/business/layoffs-new-york-times.html', 'snippet': 'The newspaper and its primary union said 21 union-represented employees would be let go by the end of the week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times and its primary union said on Tuesday that the paper was laying off at least 21 employees because it had not received enough voluntary buyouts to cover newsroom budget cuts.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Layoffs Begin at The Times After Buyouts Come Up Short', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Layoffs Begin at The Times After Buyouts Come Up Short', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Newspaper Guild, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-16T20:36:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92b542d6-f0c3-5ed2-bb11-5364135a553a', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92b542d6-f0c3-5ed2-bb11-5364135a553a'}, {'abstract': 'Despite the perception that parity exists to a greater degree in the N.F.L. than in other major professional sports, that has not been the case over the last several years in the A.F.C.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/sports/football/parity-afc-beco