ly self-centered guy (Paul Schneider) through a divorce and the perils of Internet dating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Goodbye to All That,” Otto Wall (Paul Schneider), a web designer and happy-go-lucky family man in suburban North Carolina, is caught off guard when his wife, Annie (Melanie Lynskey), summons him to her therapist’s office. While Annie wipes away tears, the therapist (Celia Weston) brusquely informs him that his 11-year marriage is over. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 328, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 328}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 559, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1118, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/17/arts/GOODBYE/GOODBYE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy':