n’t prepared properly for a test, even if there is no real test for which you need to prepare? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Litotes for Beauty', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'SAT (College Admission Test)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-17T03:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c18fe17-a068-52e5-b788-f695ca9f39b9', 'word_count': 537, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c18fe17-a068-52e5-b788-f695ca9f39b9'}, {'abstract': 'Raúl Salinas de Gortari has been cleared of charges of illicit enrichment, ending his two decades of legal battles over charges ranging from money laundering to murder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/world/americas/mexico-former-presidents-brother-is-cleared-in-a-corruption-case.html', 'snippet': 'Raúl Salinas de Gortari has been cleared of charges of illicit enrichment, ending his two decades of legal battles over charges ranging from money laundering to murder.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Raúl Salinas de Gortari, the brother of former President Carlos Salinas de Gortari, has been cleared of charges of illicit enrichment, ending his two decades of legal battles over charges ranging from money laundering to murder. This week a federal court upheld an earlier ruling that the attorney general had failed to prove that Mr. Salinas had illegally obtained money to buy properties valued at about $15 million, while holding only government jobs. He also had tens of millions of dollars in offshore accounts under aliases. Mr. Salinas, 68, spent 10 years in prison on charges of ordering his former brother-in-law’s murder but was absolved in 2005.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mexico: Former President’s Brother Is Cleared in a Corruption Case', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mexico: Former President’s Brother Is Cleared in a Corruption Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salinas de Gortari, Carlos', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salinas de Gortari, Raul (1946- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Money Laundering', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-17T03:06:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Malkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Malkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/09c3e304-2852-529f-ba6e-b05744eefe3d', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09c3e304-2852-529f-ba6e-b05744eefe3d'}, {'abstract': 'Terrence Pendergrass is charged with depriving the rights of an inmate who ingested a toxic soap ball and suffered chemical burns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/nyregion/jury-is-deciding-if-rikers-captain-ignored-a-dying-man.html', 'snippet': 'Terrence Pendergrass is charged with depriving the rights of an inmate who ingested a toxic soap ball and suffered chemical burns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was no argument about the clinical reason for Jason Echevarria’s death: The 25-year-old inmate at Rikers Island had swallowed 