 her husband, David Bowling, who were longtime city dwellers, moving to suburban New Jersey with their two young children has been something of an adjustment. Mr. Bowling has had to get used to a daily commute of more than 90 minutes each way to his job on the Upper East Side. Ms. Bowling has had to deal with a parade of service and repair workers to their home, something the couple did not have in their two-bedroom Manhattan apartment, where the super took care of everything.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/realestate/21LIVING/21LIVING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150