y turmoil on Central and Eastern European nations will depend on how much each country relies on Russian trade and visitors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WARSAW — The former Communist countries of Central and Eastern Europe are warily watching neighboring Russia’s economic struggles, girding for drops in exports and tourism but confident, in the short term at least, that the ruble’s fall will not carry their currencies with it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia’s Neighbors in Europe Warily Watch Ruble Crisis', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ruble (Currency)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-17T18:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a210894b-1b7a-5dab-9b7e-5f0258988a30', 'word_count': 637, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a210894b-1b7a-5dab-9b7e-5f0258988a30'}, {'abstract': 'There are Academy Award favorites and front-runners but no locks yet for three of the top four categories.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/18/movies/awardsseason/oscar-favorites-include-selma-boyhood-and-birdman.html', 'snippet': 'There are Academy Award favorites and front-runners but no locks yet for three of the top four categories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Psst. Wanna know who’s going to win an Oscar? The answers are here!', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'