ite girls in a wildly unfair trial.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/17/george-stinneys-conviction-tossed-out-70-years-after-execution/', 'snippet': 'A 14-year-old black boy, he was convicted of killing two white girls in a wildly unfair trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seventy years after he was executed in South Carolina, George Stinney’s conviction was vacated by a state judge Wednesday on the grounds that he had not received a fair trial.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'George Stinney’s Conviction Tossed Out … 70 Years After Execution', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stinney, George J Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-17T21:41:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse Wegman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wegman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eddd5cbf-bff6-59c6-96a6-b7255e24b4e8', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eddd5cbf-bff6-59c6-96a6-b7255e24b4e8'}, {'abstract': 'Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo, the all-male ballet troupe, brings its meticulous adoration of the art form, expressed entertainingly, to the Joyce Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/18/arts/dance/les-ballets-trockadero-de-monte-carlo-at-40-at-the-joyce.html', 'snippet': 'Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo, the all-male ballet troupe, brings its meticulous adoration of the art form, expressed entertainingly, to the Joyce Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The men of Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo — and in this troupe, that means everyone — are comedians and dancers. But perhaps even more essentially, they are aficionados of their art. Their sendups of ballet conventions show the close attention of true fans and are rendered with such love that, while they are always entertaining, they aren’t always especially comic. The comedy can be a mask for serious aspiration and ballet-nerd connoisseurship. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/18/arts/TROCKS/TROCKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gentle Laughter for a Swan’s Well-Timed Flutter and a Besotted Water Nymph', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gentle Laughter for a Swan’s Well-Timed Flutter and a Besotted Water Nymph', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joyce Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-17T21:41:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Seibert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seibert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f600d7c5-ad11-5c8c-9fde-b3486d4e8c7d', 'word_count': 449, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f600d7c5-ad11-5c8c-9fde-b3486d4e8c7d'}, {'abstract': 'A meeting just a few days before the president’s assassination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/18/upshot/when-jfk-secretly-reached-out-to-castro.html', 'snippet': 'A meeting just a few days before the president’s assassination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama’s surprise effort to restore diplomatic relations with Cuba, concurrent with an economic embargo, recalls the two-track approach — economic and sometimes military force, along with secret, sporadic attempts to find some kind of accommodation — that formed American policy toward Cuba during the most dangerous years of that relationship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/upshot/18UP-Beschloss/18UP-Beschloss-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, '