erself and her children homeless and did not publish her first book until she was nearly 60. Here we have a perfect match of biographer and subject.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19garner/19garner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dwight Garner’s 10 Favorite Books of 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dwight Garner’s Favorite Books of 2014', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belieu, Erin (1967- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cole, Teju', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jamison, Leslie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knausgaard, Karl Ove', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lerner, Ben', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lish, Atticus', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Hermione', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-18T13:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Garner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dwight', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c33371f-b4e8-5ff2-a2fd-78d1a4b56c69', 'word_count': 636, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c33371f-b4e8-5ff2-a2fd-78d1a4b56c69'}, {'abstract': 'Janet Maslin’s favorite books of the year include Beth Macy’s “Factory Man,” Michael Lewis’s “Flash Boys” and Joshua Ferris’s “To Rise Again at a Decent Hour.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/19/books/beth-macys-factory-man-michael-lewiss-flash-boys-and-more.html', 'snippet': 'Janet Maslin’s favorite books of the year include Beth Macy’s “Factory Man,” Michael Lewis’s “Flash Boys” and Joshua Ferris’s “To Rise Again at a Decent Hour.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'FACTORY MAN: How One Furniture Maker Battled Offshoring, Stayed Local — and Helped Save an American Town by Beth Macy (Little, Brown and Company). A reporter in Roanoke, Va., set out to discover what globalization had done to an Appalachian furniture business and its workers. She got the story of a lifetime. And she wrote this book in the “Seabiscuit” tradition, combining the power of truth-that’s-stranger-than-fiction with the colorful verve of a novel.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 613, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1225, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/books/19maslin/19maslin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Janet Maslin’s 10 Favorite Books of 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Janet Maslin’s 10 Favorite Books of 2014', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferris, Joshua', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 