ippet': 'The biographical essay documentary “Inside the Mind of Leonardo in 3D” aims to illustrate Leonardo da Vinci’s way of viewing the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The strange biographical essay documentary “Inside the Mind of Leonardo in 3D” has the somewhat intriguing, somewhat preposterous idea of trying to illustrate Leonardo da Vinci’s way of viewing the world. Near the outset, it shows us Leonardo’s private journals, archived in Milan. According to a title card, the words in the movie “are from Leonardo’s own.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/arts/19LEONARDO/LEONARDO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150