ich such a measure has been proposed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — A decision by the Paris City Council in March to ban smoking in public places, including restaurants, angered Brent McKee. A restaurant owner, Mr. McKee was thinking about the customers who enjoyed a cigarette or two while nursing their morning coffee.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 490}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 990, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 990, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/us/TTsmoking/TTsmoking-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Texas Once Again to Consider a Statewide Smoking Ban', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Take 5: Legislature Again to Consider Statewide Smoking Ban', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ellis, Rodney', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Geren, Charlie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-19T00:36:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aman Batheja', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aman', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Batheja', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc447824-09dc-561d-99d0-ec139e944c73', 'word_count': 589, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc447824-09dc-561d-99d0-ec139e944c73'}, {'abstract': 'Why do we draw a line between blue-collar and white-collar work?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/19/opinion/your-waitress-your-professor.html', 'snippet': 'Why do we draw a line between blue-collar and white-collar work?', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS — ON the first day of the fall semester, I left campus from an afternoon of teaching anxious college freshmen and headed to my second job, serving at a chain restaurant off Las Vegas Boulevard. The switch from my professional attire to a white dress shirt, black apron and tie reflected the separation I attempt to maintain between my two jobs. Naturally, sitting at the first table in my section was one of my new students, dining with her parents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url