w.nytimes.com/2014/12/19/sports/basketball/bulls-without-rose-edge-knicks-without-anthony-.html', 'snippet': 'Anthony sat out with pain in his left knee, and the Bulls, playing without an ill Rose, prevailed at home as the battered Knicks fell to 5-23.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — An ugly confluence of injuries and defeats has squeezed the Knicks into an awkward situation. On one hand, there is the long, growing list of players who could use a few days rest to heal their aching bodies. On the other, there is the dwindling amount of time left to keep the club’s ailing season from taking a turn for the worse.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/19/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bulls, Without Derrick Rose, Edge Knicks, Without Carmelo Anthony', 'kicker': 'Bulls 103, Knicks 97', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Anthony Out, Stoudemire Forgoes a Night Off, but the Knicks Fall Short', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-19T05:18:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/11e305b9-db02-56db-8e06-ff7bfd7e71be', 'word_count': 792, 'uri': 'nyt://article/11e305b9-db02-56db-8e06-ff7bfd7e71be'}, {'abstract': 'Two-year colleges enroll nearly half of all undergraduates in the United States. How to better educate them is critical to increasing economic mobility.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/21/nyregion/raising-ambitions-the-challenge-in-teaching-at-community-colleges.html', 'snippet': 'Two-year colleges enroll nearly half of all undergraduates in the United States. How to better educate them is critical to increasing economic mobility.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three years ago, Eduardo Vianna, a professor at LaGuardia Community College in Queens, had a student who passed an entire semester without speaking