 several fronts: the campaign against the Islamic State, the response to Russian aggression in Ukraine, the effort to stem the Ebola outbreak and the historic opening to Cuba.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/12/19/americas-resurgence-is-real/', 'snippet': 'In his opening remarks for his year-end news conference, President Obama claimed American leadership overseas on several fronts: the campaign against the Islamic State, the response to Russian aggression in Ukraine, the effort to stem the Ebola ou...', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his opening remarks for his year-end news conference, President Obama claimed American leadership overseas on several fronts: the campaign against the Islamic State, the response to Russian aggression in Ukraine, the effort to stem the Ebola outbreak and the historic opening to Cuba.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘America’s Resurgence Is Real’', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-19T19:01:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f18b5505-17a1-57e7-b0d8-432923bd4224', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f18b5505-17a1-57e7-b0d8-432923bd4224'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to cultural events for children, teenagers and families in New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/19/arts/spare-times-for-