 photos, Instagram snaps, Facebook posts and more, creates a collage from what it thinks might be your most cherished moments and lets you share them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/21/nyregion/an-app-memoir-guesses-your-fondest-memories-.html', 'snippet': 'Memoir, a time-capsule app that resurfaces photos, Instagram snaps, Facebook posts and more, creates a collage from what it thinks might be your most cherished moments and lets you share them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The holidays are as much a time for nostalgia as they are for celebration. As the new year approaches, we take stock of what we have done over the past 12 months and reminisce with friends and loved ones. And while some might say that there is not much place for smartphones in all that human connection, an app called Memoir provides a service that its creators, based in New York, hope will be essential to that holiday spirit.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/nyregion/21APPCITY/21APPCITY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/21/nyregion/21APPCITY/21APPCITY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 603}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/nyregion/21APPCITY/21APPCITY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1019, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/nyregion/21APPCITY/21APPCITY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1446, 'width': 1438, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/nyregio