 dynasty. Ms. Cuomo and her husband, Christopher, both 44, are themselves a media power couple. She is the editor in chief of Manhattan and Beach magazines, and her husband is a television journalist and the anchor of “New Day” on CNN. They live on the Upper East Side of Manhattan with their three children, Bella, 11, Mario, 8 and Carolina, 4, and their dog, Alabama.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cristina Cuomo: Escaping New York City, or Delighting in It', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Escaping the City, or Delighting in It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Cristina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manhattan (Magazine)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beach (Magazine)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southampton (NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Christopher', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-19T21:48:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Satow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Satow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85e153cd-7efd-5d2c-9b74-9cf04265b5b5', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85e153cd-7efd-5d2c-9b74-9cf04265b5b5'}, {'abstract': 'Considered rationally, giving gifts is economically inefficient, some economists argue. But that doesn’t mean they always practice what they preach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/21/upshot/an-economist-g