rs. Here are the results, ranked primarily from reader stats (most emailed, most viewed) and from an estimation of how influential the column was in terms of media coverage and social media response.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 192, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 192}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO/21BESTOFMODERNLOVE_COMBO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline'