aturday evening. During this interlude, Jews are encouraged to reflect and to remember, to appreciate family and to seek a sense of peace. And to eat. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Brooklyn, Racing Against the Shabbat Clock at Kings Highway Glatt', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Long as Light and Custom Allow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kings Highway Glatt (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gravesend (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Butchers and Butchering', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-19T22:21:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Cotto', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotto', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7074977c-4b80-5a3a-b546-e46d9bf01420', 'word_count': 600, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7074977c-4b80-5a3a-b546-e46d9bf01420'}, {'abstract': 'Her rise has been steady over a decade, but in 2014, she has soared to new heights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/12/21/fashion/20141221-SWIFT.html', 'snippet': 'Her rise has been steady over a decade, but in 2014, she has soared to new heights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Her rise has been steady over a decade, but in 2014, she has soared to new heights.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/20141221-SWIFT-slide-1VJF/20141221-SWIFT-slide-1VJF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy'