': 'She traded Nashville for New York, released the chart-topping pop album “1989,” took on Spotify and has an updated sense of style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/21/fashion/the-year-of-taylor-swift.html', 'snippet': 'She traded Nashville for New York, released the chart-topping pop album “1989,” took on Spotify and has an updated sense of style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Taylor Swift trajectory has unfurled with the cheery and ironclad inevitability of a Taylor Swift song. Like you or I, Taylor Swift was once 15, an age when (as documented in her song “Fifteen”), she was a lanky outsider “laughing at the other girls who think they’re so cool” promising “we’ll be outta here as soon as we can.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21SUB-SWIFT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21SUB-SWIFT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21SUB-SWIFT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21SUB-SWIFT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21SUB-SWIFT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/21/fashion/21SUBSWIFT1/21S