k range in their patrol car Saturday by a man who, officials said, had traveled to the city from Baltimore vowing to kill officers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two police officers sitting in their patrol car in Brooklyn were shot at point-blank range and killed on Saturday afternoon by a man who, officials said, had traveled to the city from Baltimore vowing to kill officers. The suspect then committed suicide with the same gun, the authorities said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 N.Y.P.D. Officers Killed in Brooklyn Ambush; Suspect Commits Suicide', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Officers, Ambushed, Are Killed in Brooklyn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brinsley, Ismaaiyl Abdullah', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, Wenjian (1982-2014)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ramos, Rafael (1974-2014)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Eric', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bedford-Stuyvesant (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-20T21:20:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Mueller and