to them, my kids, now 19 and 16, are teaching me to see the world—and my in-laws—with new eyes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our youngest child hasn’t even left the nest yet, but my husband already dreams of a time when our adult children will boomerang home. He wants my mother to live with us, too. We both like to imagine the dynamism and mutual support of a multigenerational household. During the holidays – with our daughter home from college and grandparents on both sides visiting – we get to live our fantasy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 937, 'width': 1419, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/07/31/fashion/motherlode-piercing/motherlode-piercing-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None