partment will issue its final estimate for third-quarter growth, and data for November will be released for durable goods, income, spending and new-home sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FINAL UPDATE ON GROWTH FOR THIRD QUARTER ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/business/ahead/ahead-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Third-Quarter Growth and November Consumer Data', 'kicker': 'The Week Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Third-Quarter Growth and November Consumer Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Durable Goods (Economic Indicator)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-21T21:31:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nelson D. Schwartz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nelson', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7167962-a6a4-5836-b882-6124afe577a5', 'word_count': 147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7167962-a6a4-5836-b882-6124afe577a5'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Seger, an exponent of soulful rock since the 1960s, played his hits and other songs that gently blended politics with the personal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/22/arts/music/bob-seger-and-the-silver-bullet-band-roar-into-the-garden.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Seger, an exponent of soulful rock since the 1960s, played his hits and other songs that gently blended politics with the personal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Seger didn’t show any rock-star vanity when he headlined Madison Square Garden on Friday night. Mr. Seger is 69; his hair and beard were gray and he wore glasses, an untucked black shirt and bluejeans. Soon after he started his set, he put on a sweatband that he would, about two hours later, fling into the crowd. There was no dress code in his Silver Bullet Band, either; they weren’t onstage to pose. The show was in the songs that were played as straightforwardly as they deserved. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/arts/SEGER/SEGER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Muscle Car of Rock Still Purrs and Roars ', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Muscle Car of Rock Still Purrs and Roars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seger, Bob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silver Bullet Band (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-21T21:54:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d6b38ad-e861-5b24-b79e-d28c4aa9c061', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d6b38ad-e861-5b24-b79e-d28c4aa9c061'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Brady was sacked three times early, and the Jets, although booed multiple times, led entering the fourth quarter. But a conversion of a third-and-7 helped the Patriots seal the victory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/22/sports/football/new-york-jets-defense-flusters-tom-brady-but-new-england-patriots-rally-to-win-in-possibly-rex-ryans-last-home-game.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Brady was sacked three times early, and the Jets, although booed multiple times, led entering the fourth quarter. But a conversion of a third-and-7 helped the Patriots seal the victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — It has been weeks since the Jets actually had something to play for; since fans had reason to cheer; since Coach Rex Ryan had cause to smile. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets Keep Patriots at Bay, Then Revert to Type Against Their Rivals ', 'kicker': 'Patriots 17, Jets 16', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jets Keep Patriots at Bay, Then Revert to Type Against Their Rivals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belichick, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Folk, Nick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Idzik, John', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Woody', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value