yt://article/dc68b8a5-1dc0-5e30-8e70-eb13dafb0c45'}, {'abstract': 'In the run-up to the Iraq invasion, Ruby Washington went to the United Nations hoping to find a different kind of image. She found it when Secretary of State Colin Powell was handed a note.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/22/ready-and-waiting-for-the-moment-to-unfold/', 'snippet': 'In the run-up to the Iraq invasion, Ruby Washington went to the United Nations hoping to find a different kind of image. She found it when Secretary of State Colin Powell was handed a note.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was another busy day at the United Nations Security Council meeting on Feb. 14, 2003. Another day of photographing in a controlled and very restrictive environment. My assignment was to look for a different kind of photograph — to make something interesting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ready and Waiting for the Moment to Unfold', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blix, Hans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Powell, Colin L', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Preston, Julia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Straw, Jack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date