le/d983fe8e-46fe-5fb4-8e06-fc0568b38ed1'}, {'abstract': 'Maybe the perfect gift is one that arrives later, in the form of a monthly delivery of books, geek toys, craft supplies or more.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/22/last-minute-gifts-monthly-box-subscriptions-for-children-and-teenagers/', 'snippet': 'Maybe the perfect gift is one that arrives later, in the form of a monthly delivery of books, geek toys, craft supplies or more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A subscription is the gift that keeps on giving, and children (and teenagers and adults, too) still love getting their own mail (or UPS or FedEx delivery, as the case may be). Tempted as I am by these extra possibilities, I’m not buying one more nonnecessity until February. But if I were still shopping, these fun boxes suited to various ages and interests would be where I would turn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/us/motherlode-kidstir/motherlode-kidstir-articleLarge.png', 'height': 304, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/22/us/motherlode-kidstir/motherlode-kidstir-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 304}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/us/motherlode-kidstir/motherlode-kidstir-jumbo.png', 'height': 479, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/us/motherlode-kidstir/motherlode-kidstir-superJumbo.png', 'height': 479, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/22/us/motherlode-kidstir/motherlode-kidstir-thumbStandard.png', 'he