}, {'abstract': 'The long-running Broadway hit cleared the $2 million mark at the box office last week, and is set to be the year’s top-selling show, ahead of “Wicked.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/22/a-big-week-and-a-big-year-for-the-lion-king-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The long-running Broadway hit cleared the $2 million mark at the box office last week, and is set to be the year’s top-selling show, ahead of “Wicked.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long-running Broadway hit “The Lion King” cleared the $2 million mark at the box office last week — the only show to do so out of 36 running — another big number for a musical that will stand as the top-grossing show of the year when 2014 concludes. According to box-office data released on Monday, “The Lion King” grossed $2,200,409, beating another durable blockbuster, “Wicked,” which took in $1,986,719.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Big Week, and a Big Year, for ‘The Lion King’ on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘The Lion King’ Clears The $2 Million Mark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Broadway (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-22T21:19:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d7749fc-c886-54b3-aad3-1307ea1bb2d7', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d7749fc-c886-54b3-aad3-1307ea1bb2d7'}, {'abstract': 'A study shows that in a year, those who used heroin only intermittently lost more CD4 blood cells than those who did not use it. Regular users had a slightly higher CD4 count.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/23/health/for-heroin-users-less-may-be-worse-for-hiv-.html', 'snippet': 'A study shows that in a year, those who used heroin only intermittently lost more CD4 blood cells than those who did not use it. Regular users had a slightly higher CD4 count.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Occasional heroin use may be worse for the immune system than continual heroin use, according to a new study.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Heroin Users, Less May Reduce Immune Cells ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Heroin Users, Less May Reduce Immune Cells', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeil, Donald G Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AIDS and Behavior (Journal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-22T21:20:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Donald G. McNeil Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Donald', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'McNeil', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d4141b3-ea2e-5b36-915f-4bc2dc038487', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d4141b3-ea2e-5b36-915f-4bc2dc038487'}, {'abstract': 'The all-male troupe Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo continues to shine in the second program of its anniversary season in i