since the recent Ebola outbreak. Only 27.9 percent of all registered voters turned out to vote. More results will be released Wednesday, and the final results will be released in January. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Liberia: Soccer Star Leads Senate Race', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Liberia: Soccer Star Leads Senate Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sirleaf, Robert A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weah, George', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-23T01:07:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clair MacDougall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacDougall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/830e907e-545a-5c1c-a55e-a90e0bc7c598', 'word_count': 105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/830e907e-545a-5c1c-a55e-a90e0bc7c598'}, {'abstract': 'Willard State Psychiatric Hospital in upstate New York will permit a memorial in the name of the man who dug more than 1,500 graves for his fellow patients.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/23/us/no-longer-anonymous-gravedigger-gets-his-due-at-a-psychiatric-hospital.html', 'snippet': 'Willard State Psychiatric Hospital in upstate New York will permit a memorial in the name of the man who dug more than 1,500 graves for his fellow patients.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over several decades, an immigrant dug more than 1,500 graves for his fellow patients at Willard State Psychiatric Hospital in upstate New York. He took