ial misfit with a longstanding grudge against authority in general, and the police in particular.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/23/nyregion/gunman-may-have-used-garner-and-brown-cases-to-justify-police-killings-experts-say.html', 'snippet': 'Like most people who assault uniformed officers, experts said, Ismaaiyl Brinsley was most likely a social misfit with a longstanding grudge against authority in general, and the police in particular.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The portrait of Ismaaiyl Brinsley — the 28-year-old man who the authorities say fatally shot two New York police officers last weekend, before killing himself — is still being filled out. But the facts that have surfaced so far, experts say, suggest that he was neither a political activist nor a psychotic madman.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/nyregion/MENTAL/MENTAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/23/nyregion/MENTAL/MENTAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 847}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/nyregion/MENTAL/MENTAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 726, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/nyregion/MENTAL/MENTAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1103, 'width': 781, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/nyregion/MENTAL/MENTAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/23/n