tname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/988efe78-f4fe-5544-9a44-1f8fb996411d', 'word_count': 1028, 'uri': 'nyt://article/988efe78-f4fe-5544-9a44-1f8fb996411d'}, {'abstract': 'This year, my husband will return from his predeployment work-ups to spend Christmas with us, and my daughter will get her wish. Next year, there will be nothing even Santa can do.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/23/dear-santa-please-bring-daddy/', 'snippet': 'This year, my husband will return from his predeployment work-ups to spend Christmas with us, and my daughter will get her wish. Next year, there will be nothing even Santa can do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Standing on top of the 10-foot ladder, just higher than the “do not go above this step” label, I said a silent prayer that I wouldn’t fall and break my neck during nap time. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/us/motherlode-tessa9/motherlode-tessa9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 521, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/us/motherlode-tessa9/motherlode-tessa9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 521, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/23/us/motherlode-tessa9/motherlode-tessa9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/23/us/motherlode-tessa9/motherlode-tessa9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th