anadian Convicted in Body Parts Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Magnotta, Luka Rocco', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lin, Jun', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-23T18:10:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53a18c71-2a06-50e9-a87d-ae2e9b3bdcb7', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53a18c71-2a06-50e9-a87d-ae2e9b3bdcb7'}, {'abstract': 'Indulging in this dish won’t require a New Year’s resolution afterward.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/24/dining/a-whole-grain-macaroni-and-cheese-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'Indulging in this dish won’t require a New Year’s resolution afterward.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During Christmas vacation, there are always extra mouths to feed at my house, and lots of dinner parties and potlucks for which I need to prepare. So I’m always thinking casseroles, those utterly practical and satisfying dishes that can be made ahead and reheated. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/dining/24MARTHA/24MARTHA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/24/dining/24MARTHA/24MARTHA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth':