b_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/23/documents-shed-new-light-on-louis-armstrongs-youth/', 'snippet': 'Some intriguing details are added to accounts of Louis Armstrong’s early days in New Orleans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the signal moments in American jazz took place in 1913, when Louis Armstrong entered the Colored Waif’s Home in New Orleans, sent by the authorities for firing a pistol to celebrate New Year’s Eve. It was there that he picked up a bugle, and then a cornet. The rest, as they say, is history.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Documents Shed New Light on Louis Armstrong’s Youth', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Documents Shed Light On Armstrong’s Youth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMSTRONG, LOUIS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Orleans (La)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-23T20:10:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bc467d4-a088-54ed-9995-6a335553060c', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bc467d4-a088-54ed-9995-6a335553060c'}, {'abstract': 'Fresh, funky and affordable, the hotel is a modern haven in touristy Times Square.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/travel/hotel-review-citizenm-in-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'Fresh, funky and affordable, the hotel is a modern haven in touristy Times Square.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xadDoubles start at $199.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge'