 “The Taking of Pelham One Two Three,” in 1974.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/24/arts/television/joseph-sargent-an-emmy-winner-who-directed-pelham-one-two-three-dies-at-89.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sargent, who won four Primetime Emmys, was director of the film “The Taking of Pelham One Two Three,” in 1974.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joseph Sargent, a director who won four Primetime Emmy Awards for television movies but whose best-known work was the 1974 thriller “The Taking of Pelham One Two Three,” which chillingly presented the embattled New York City of the 1970s, died on Monday at his home in Malibu, Calif. He was 89. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 973, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 973}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 632, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1263, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/24/arts/SARGENT1obit/SARGENT1obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt