nyt://article/d6d12808-4e2c-5f6b-a542-baba8e06914b'}, {'abstract': 'Opening emails can transmit a plethora of data to marketers and scammers, but there are solutions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/25/technology/personaltech/ways-to-avoid-email-tracking.html', 'snippet': 'Opening emails can transmit a plethora of data to marketers and scammers, but there are solutions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By now you probably know that browsing the web leaves you open to tracking by Internet service providers, website operators and advertisers. But less well known is that you can be tracked simply by opening an email. Merely clicking or tapping to open a message can transmit to the sender not only that you opened it, but also where you were when you did so and on what device, among other things.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/25/technology/personaltech/25gadgetwise-illo/25gadgetwise-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 485, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/25/technology/personaltech/25gadgetwise-illo/25gadgetwise-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 485}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/25/technology/personaltech/25gadgetwise-illo/25gadgetwise-illo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 828, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/25/technology/personaltech/25gadgetwise-illo/25gadgetwise-illo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1656, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/25/technolog