President Ashraf Ghani is frustrated with what he sees as mismanagement of the United Nations Development Program, which bankrolls the salaries of Afghanistan’s police officers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/25/world/asia/president-ashraf-ghani-of-afghanistan-tells-united-nations-agency-to-relinquish-control-of-funds-officials-say.html', 'snippet': 'Officials said President Ashraf Ghani is frustrated with what he sees as mismanagement of the United Nations Development Program, which bankrolls the salaries of Afghanistan’s police officers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — In his drive to rid Afghanistan of mismanagement and waste, President Ashraf Ghani has chosen a large and rather unexpected target: the United Nations Development Program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghan Leader Tells U.N. Agency to Relinquish Control of Funds, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghan Leader Tells U.N. Agency to Relinquish Control of Funds, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ahmed, Azam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ghani, Ashraf', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Development Program', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-25T00:28:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azam Ahmed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organi