estive and wistful night. Not a problem. There are a number of ways to spend New Year’s Eve that involve television but won’t expose you to whoever is trying to replace Dick Clark these days. Let’s break them down into three broad categories: NEIL GENZLINGER', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 534, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 534}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 911, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1425, 'width': 1602, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/TVEVE4/TVEVE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ringing Out the Old With a TV Binge', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ringing Out the Old With a TV Binge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords'