r’s Eve at 54 Below, is becoming known for her unguarded, often self-deprecating wit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/26/arts/music/laura-benanti-takes-on-54-below-and-her-career.html', 'snippet': 'Laura Benanti, singing cabaret on New Year’s Eve at 54 Below, is becoming known for her unguarded, often self-deprecating wit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AMONG the moments that made 2014 memorable for Laura Benanti, in addition to a busy stage schedule and a role on the ABC series “Nashville,” was the time in September when a man sidled up to her and whispered a single word into her ear: “juicy.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/26/arts/26BENANTI/26BENANTI-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i