l will have some tough personnel decisions to make in the off-season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A victory Sunday against the Philadelphia Eagles would mean a second consecutive 7-9 season for the Giants, which is certainly one definition of a team that has failed to improve. Missing the playoffs in five of the last six seasons usually signals a lack of progress as well.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/DOG-pennington/DOG-pennington-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Will Revamp, but in a Considered Fashion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants Will Revamp, but in a Considered Fashion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coughlin, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAdoo, Ben', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-27T17:34:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34ad330f-2815-5e86-bc93-859d11ae52f2', 'word_count': 1100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34ad330f-2815-5e86-bc93-859d11ae52f2'}, {'abstract': 'Extra vigilance is required during prolonged periods of low interest rates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/opinion/sunday/the-fed-fights-half-the-battle.html', 'snippet': 'Extra vigilance is required during prolonged periods of low interest rates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At its recent meeting, the last of the the year, the Federal Reserve said it was in no great hurry to lift interest rates — and that’s a good thing. Higher rates make sense when a strong job market pushes up wages and consumer prices. Currently, though, job growth is still too slow, unemployment too high, raises too measly and inflation too low to warrant a rate increase. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fed Fights Half the Battle ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Fed Fights Half the Battle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-27T17:39:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/64a95cd5-c099-507d-aca3-5d6687093eaf', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64a95cd5-c099-507d-aca3-5d6687093eaf'}, {'abstract': 'Here are the winners and honorable mentions of my poetry contest on race.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/27/winners-of-my-poetry-contest-about-race/', 'snippet': 'Here are the winners and honorable mentions of my poetry contest on race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here are the winners of my poetry contest on race. Please post your comments on the poems — or on the column or the contest — below.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Winners of My Poetry Contest About Race', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kristof, Nicholas D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'm