icle/031b98f3-1a50-5cbb-bb24-41a45619067f'}, {'abstract': 'Denver blew a shot at home-field advantage throughout the playoffs by losing to the Bengals, but they can still secure the second seed and a first-round bye with a victory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/sports/football/oakland-raiders-at-denver-broncos-preview.html', 'snippet': 'Denver blew a shot at home-field advantage throughout the playoffs by losing to the Bengals, but they can still secure the second seed and a first-round bye with a victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Raiders (3-12) at Broncos (11-4)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oakland Raiders at Denver Broncos: Prediction', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Broncos', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Raiders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-27T18:04:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brett Michael Dykes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brett', 'middlename': 'Michael', 'lastname': 'Dykes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92b18319-62f9-53e9-9b54-a19412b4ab0f', 'word_count': 193, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92b18319-62f9-53e9-9b54-a19412b4ab0f'}, {'abstract': 'Phil Jackson, Fisher’s boss with the Knicks, advised a newly retired Brian Shaw to step away from the game before seeking a coaching job.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/sports/basketball/fishers-transition-to-knicks-coach-is-quick-but-far-from-smooth.html', 'snippet': 'Phil Jackson, Fisher’s boss with the Knicks, advised a newly retired Brian Shaw to step away from the game before seeking a coaching job.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was 2003, and Brian Shaw was a newly retired N.B.A. player pondering how to make the transition into the next phase of his professional life. Although he had clear ambitions to become a coach in the league, Shaw received a memorable piece of advice from Phil Jackson that would briefly divert his path.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/sports/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1/sug-DOG-jp-coaches1-thumbLarge