 government now pays for gender reassignment surgery.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/anas-story-gender-reassignment-in-cuba/', 'snippet': 'After decades of oppression of people who identify as L.G.B.T., the Cuban government now pays for gender reassignment surgery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the 1960s and 1970s, the Cuban government brutally repressed sexual minorities, but in the last seven years there has been an evolution of rights for people who identify as L.G.B.T. This transformation was led by Mariela Castro, a straight woman who is the daughter of the current president, Raúl Castro.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ana’s Story: Gender Reassignment in Cuba', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexuals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castro Espin, Mariela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castro, Raul', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nieman Foundation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-28T14:00:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01b75d40-66e2-544c-a4f3-f6e987e48a44', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01b75d40-66e2-544c-a4f3-f6e987e48a44'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The British waged a raid on the German coast on Christmas eve, 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/28/1914-british-raid-heligoland/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The British waged a raid on the German coast on Christmas eve, 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The latest despatches which have come to hand concerning the British naval raid on the German fleet off Cuxhaven show that it was an eminently satisfactory exploit, carefully thought out and arranged weeks before, and brilliantly executed. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-articleLarge.png', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-jumbo.png', 'height': 521, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-superJumbo.png', 'height': 521, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/28/blogs/28iht-old29/28iht-old29-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: Royal Navy Stages Joint Sea and Air Strike on Cuxhaven', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRSHIPS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Submarines and Submersibles', 'ran