aris had ever been a Royalist or Imperialist city, and that the Church had once been an important factor in municipal life. In some cases the changes made have been for the better; in some other cases Parisians almost unanimously agree the changes have been much for the worse and not worth the inconvenience they have caused.— The New York Herald, European Edition, Dec. 30, 1889', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 756, 'width': 1155, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretrospective-Paris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/blogs/30-ihtretrospective-Paris/30-ihtretro