 'value': 'Ku Klux Klan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stormfront.org', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Southern Poverty Law Center', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-30T00:35:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker and Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e7e242d-ebe8-56c6-8433-402cfe916dbe', 'word_count': 612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e7e242d-ebe8-56c6-8433-402cfe916dbe'}, {'abstract': 'A flight attendant’s mishap foils the usual early-morning flight plan for the chief operating officer of the Breeders’ Cup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/30/business/in-a-position-beyond-his-control.html', 'snippet': 'A flight attendant’s mishap foils the usual early-morning flight plan for the chief operating officer of the Breeders’ Cup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A LOT of my career was spent in the banking industry. I didn’t travel much for work, and if I did it was all short-haul regional trips. Every now and then I would get to go to some big group meeting that involved a longer flight and I would get kind of excited. Though business travel was limited, my wife and I always enjoyed traveling for leisure and exploring the world. Neither of us had that opportunity when we were growing up, and now that we have children we want to show them what the world offers, both here and overseas.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/30/business/Flier/Flier-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Position Beyond His Control', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Position Beyond His Control', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Breeders' Cup (Horse Races)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elliston, Robert N', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'