rning, and there’s a snowstorm in the afternoon and floods in the subways in the evening. And then you have two planes hit the World Trade Center in the middle of the night.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-12-30T07:21:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc537046-ebc8-5562-b86b-28c8870d15c4', 'word_count': 72, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc537046-ebc8-5562-b86b-28c8870d15c4'}, {'abstract': 'Rescue teams off the coast of Borneo found bodies and debris from the AirAsia plane that disappeared Sunday, but it remained unknown why the plane went down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/31/world/asia/airasia-8501-jet-missing-indonesia.html', 'snippet': 'Rescue teams off the coast of Borneo found bodies and debris from the AirAsia plane that disappeared Sunday, but it remained unknown why the plane went down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SURABAYA, Indonesia — The mystery of Indonesia’s missing airliner was partly solved on Tuesday, when rescue teams retrieved and tallied a grim inventory of bodies and debris from the plane off the coast of southwestern Borneo.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Searchers Pull\xa0AirAsia Plane Debris and Bodies From Java Sea', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Searchers Pull Jet Debris and Bodies From Java Sea', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fuller, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AirAsia Flight 8501', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AIRASIA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-30T08:22:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4ff5493-162c-55a6-932c-577e7c9a7d82', 'word_count': 956, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4ff5493-162c-55a6-932c-577e7c9a7d82'}, {'abstract': 'A photographer has traveled through Canada’s frozen climes in search of ice huts, primitive, portable shelters built by fishermen.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/12/30/freeze-frames-of-canadas-ice-huts/', 'snippet': 'A photographer has traveled through Canada’s frozen climes in search of ice huts, primitive, portable shelters built by fishermen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Johnson likes ice fishermen just fine. He has shared drinks with them. He has learned a bit about their lives while crammed into the huts where they carve out small patches of warmth from the bitter expanse of cold outside.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Freeze Frames of Canada’s Ice Huts', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Richard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Toronto (Ontario)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-12-30T10:00:25+0000', 'document_