90, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4730184a-97e4-575a-b0a2-fe8cf48764a0'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Sprenger won victories for minorities, older workers and women, including a landmark sexual harassment case on behalf of female miners, on which the film “North Country” was based.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/31/us/paul-sprenger-lawyer-who-fought-discrimination-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sprenger won victories for minorities, older workers and women, including a landmark sexual harassment case on behalf of female miners, on which the film “North Country” was based.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul C. Sprenger, a Washington lawyer who represented female iron miners in Minnesota in the nation’s first class-action lawsuit focused on sexual harassment — at the time an emerging legal concept — died on Monday while on vacation in Curaçao. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/31/us/SPRENGER-obit/SPRENGER-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/12/31/us/SPRENGER-obit/SPRENGER-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/31/us/SPRENGER-obit/SPRENGER-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 993, 'width': 715, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/31/us/SPRENGER-obit/SPRENGER-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 993, 'width': 715, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/12/31/us/SPRENGER-obit/SPRENGER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,