237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b407811c-50ab-5101-9b57-181505c769a3'}, {'abstract': 'Already, a series of unrelated policy decisions has reduced the ability to track family change in America.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/01/upshot/census-bureaus-plan-to-cut-marriage-and-divorce-questions-has-academics-up-in-arms.html', 'snippet': 'Already, a series of unrelated policy decisions has reduced the ability to track family change in America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the Census Bureau proceeds with a recently released plan, then in a few years’ time, we will know very little about how the contours of family life are changing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/01UP-Divorce/01UP-Divorce-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':