.com/2015/01/04/theater/tony-danza-stars-in-honeymoon-in-vegas-on-broadway.html', 'snippet': 'Tony Danza pulls out all the stops for the Broadway musical “Honeymoon in Vegas,” in which he plays a starring role.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The price of poker just went up, boys,” Tony Danza declared as he tossed $10 worth of chips into the center of a dining table, where a modest but growing pot sat beside a plate of peppers and anchovies. The financial stakes were low, but the game held an important social value to this 63-year-old Brooklyn-born actor and one-man welcoming committee. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 497, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 497}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1697, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA/04DANZA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04DANZA