 'uri': 'nyt://article/93f4930a-768c-519a-bcc6-5c78d3c4c64a'}, {'abstract': 'Nick Asbury, a creator of the world’s most depressing datebook, on starting off the year with a fresh load of pessimism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/01/garden/perpetual-disappointments-diary-not-for-pollyannas.html', 'snippet': 'Nick Asbury, a creator of the world’s most depressing datebook, on starting off the year with a fresh load of pessimism.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xadNick Asbury claims he is not a pessimist but “more of a frustrated idealist at heart.” The British writer is the author and co-creator, with his wife, Sue, of the Perpetual Disappointments Diary, a weekly planner offering a list of notable deaths, a blank section called “Notes Toward an Abandoned Screenplay,” a place for the addresses of people who never call and useful phrases in five languages (including “I am on the wrong plane” and “Do you have any very cheap wine?”).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/01/garden/01QNA1-copy/QNA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/01/garden/01QNA1-copy/QNA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/01/garden/01QNA1-copy/QNA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/01/garden/01QNA1-copy/QNA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/01/garden/01QN